<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id" />
  <para style="h">YUBU</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buk pa Yubu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yubu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yub</para>
  <para style="mt2">Buk pa</para>
  <para style="mt1">YUBU</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Buk pa Yubu </char> tito lok ikom laco mo ma kite ber adada ma odeno can lumuku. En orwenyo lutinone ki lonyone ducu lawang acel. Medo ikom meno en bene obedo ki two mamiyo dano pe twero bedo ingete pi ngwec kome.</para>
  <para style="ip">Dong i dul lok adek mapatpat lacoc onyutu kamaleng kit ma lurem Yubu ki en Yubu kikome gutato te peko ma opoto ikom Yubuni. I agikine Lubanga kikome, ma kit ma en tiyo kwede ki dano, ma obedo teguti me tato telok man, aye onyute bot Yubu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lurem Yubu gutito pi can ma otime ikom Yubu kun lubu pwony me dini me kare meno. Gin onongo tamo ni Lubanga pwodo lubalo ento miyo gum bot jo ma kitgi beco. Pimeno can pa Yubu nyutu ni en otimo bal. Ento ki tung bot Yubu tam pa lureme lam mada pien en ebedo dano ma kite atir adada dok elworo Lubanga, ma weko en pe eromo limo pwod ma lit kitmeno. Yubu otito ni pe eromo niang kit ma Lubanga weko can malit poto ikom dano macalo en, ma oweko en openyo Lubanga me tite te pekone. Yubu pe orwenyo niyene kono olego ni myero emede ki bedo dano ma opore inyim Lubanga dok emede ki bedo dano ma kite atir ma lworo Lubanga.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lubanga pe ogamo lapeny pa Yubu ento odok ilok ma mako niye pa Yubu ki peny madongo ma nyutu dit, twero ki ryeko pa Lubanga. Yubu cutcut omwole kun oye ni Lubanga dit ci ongut pi lok lataya ki akemo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Agiki me buk man nyutu kit ma Lubanga odwoko gum ki lonyo pa Yubu cen ma ododo kit ma en onongo tye kwede con. Lubanga ki tungcel oketo lewic ikom lurem Yubu pien gin pe guniang guti me can pa Yubu. Kono Yubu keken aye oniang ni Lubanga dit loyo kit ma dano niang kwede.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Kit ma lok kom Yubu ocake kwede <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 1:1-2:13">1:1—2:13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yubu ki lureme <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 3:1-31:40">3:1—31:40</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">a. Yubu obako doge <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 3:1-26">3:1-26</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">b. Dul lok mukwongo <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 4:1-14:22">4:1—14:22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">c. Dul lok me aryone <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 15:1-21:34">15:1—21:34</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">d. Dul lok me adeke <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 22:1-27:23">22:1—27:23</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">e. Ryeko pire tek <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 28:1-28">28:1-28</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">f. Lok pa Yubu me agiki bot lureme <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 29:1-31:40">29:1—31:40</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lok pa Eliu <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 32:1-37:24">32:1—37:24</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Rwot ogamo dog Yubu <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 38:1-42:6">38:1—42:6</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kit ma lok kom Yubu ogik kwede <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 42:7-17">42:7-17</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOB 1" />
  <para style="s1">Catan otemo Yubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 1:1" />Yam tye dano mo i lobo Uj ma nyinge Yubu. Dano man onongo peke ki bal mo, dok dano ma cwinye leng ma lworo Lubanga, dok dag tim marac. <verse eid="JOB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 1:2" />En onywalo awobe abiro ki anyira adek. <verse eid="JOB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 1:3" />Lim mayam tye bote obedo romi alip abiro, kinaga alip adek, twoni pur alip acel, megi kana miya abic. En onongo tye ki lutice mapol adada; ma oweko en obedo dano madit makato jo ducu matye tung kunyango.<verse eid="JOB 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 1:4" />Awobe pa Yubu yam gimaro cito kacamo karama i ot pa ngat acel acel i ninone; ci gicwalo kwena gilwongo nyimegigi adeki kacam ki kamat kwedgi. <verse eid="JOB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 1:5" />Ka kare me karamagi otum, ci Yubu yam cwalo kwena, lwongogi ci lonyogi. En yam a malo odiko con, ci tyero gitum awanga ma oporo welgi ducu, pien Yubu onongo tamo ni, gwok onyo awobene gubalo nyo guyeto Lubanga ki i cwinygi. En yam timo kitmeno kare ki kare.<verse eid="JOB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 1:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 6:2">Aca 6:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Inino mo acel ma lumalaika pa Lubanga gubino gucung inyim Rwot, ci Catan bene obino ikin gi. <verse eid="JOB 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 1:7" />Rwot openyo Catan ni, “In ia ki kwene?” Catan ogamo dog Rwot kun waco ni, “An aa kawire iwi lobo, ki kawot ikin piny i lobo.” <verse eid="JOB 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 1:8" />Ci Rwot dok owaco bot Catan ni. “Itamo pi latica Yubu? Pe tye ngat mo macalo en iwi lobo, en dano ma peke ki bal mo, en dano ma cwinye atir, ma lworo Lubanga, dok dag tim maracu” <verse eid="JOB 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 1:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:10">Niy 12:10</ref></char></note>Catan ogamo dog Rwot kun waco ni, “Itamo ni Yubu lwori nono? <verse eid="JOB 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 1:10" />Pe in aye igwoke tungi ki tungi, kacel ki ode ki jami ducu ma en tye kwede? In imiyo gum ikom tic me cinge, ki lime bene onya omede i lobo. <verse eid="JOB 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 1:11" />Ento tugi keto cingi cut, wek igud gin ducu ma en tye kwede, ci en tugi yeti ki inyimi cut” <verse eid="JOB 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 1:12" />Ci Rwot owaco bot Catan ni, “Nen, gin ducu ma en tye kwede tye itweroni; kono nyo ikom en keken aye pe iket cingi.” Kumeno Catan oa ocito woko ki inyim Rwot.<verse eid="JOB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yubu orwenyo lonyone ki lutinone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 1:13" />Inino mo acel, awobe ki anyira pa Yubu gubedo kacam ki kamato kongo bwino i ot pa omin gi madite; <verse eid="JOB 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 1:14" />ci lakwena mo obino bot Yubu ma waco ni, “Ikare ma twoni gitye kapur, ki kana bene gicamo kangetgi, <verse eid="JOB 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 1:15" />ci jo Ceba gupoto ikomgi, guyakogi, guneko lukwat woko ki pala lucwan: ci an kena aye abwot me bino ka titi.” <verse eid="JOB 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 1:16" />Ma onongo en pud tye kalok, ngat mukene dok obino ma owaco ni, “Mac pa Lubanga oa ki i polo, ci owango romi ki lukwat, otyekogi woko ducu; ci an kena aye abwot me bino ka titi.”<verse eid="JOB 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 1:17" />Ma onongo en pud tye kalok, ngat mukene dok obino ma owaco ni, “Jo Kaldaya gupoke i buca adek, ci guture ikom kinaga, guyakogi, ci guneko lukwat ki pala lucwan; ci an kena aye abwot me bino ka titi.”<verse eid="JOB 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 1:18" />Ma en pud tye kalok, ngat mukene dok obino ma owaco ni, “Awobeni ki anyirani onongo gitye kacam ki kamato kongo bwino i ot pa omin gi madite, <verse eid="JOB 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 1:19" />ci nen, yamo madit obino, ongole ki tung tim, oyoko twok ot angwen, ot opoto ikom lutino omiyo guto woko; ci an kena aye abwot me bino ka titi.”<verse eid="JOB 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 1:20" />Yubu oa malo, oyeco jore, olyelo wiye, oryebe piny ingom, ci oworo Lubanga. <verse eid="JOB 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 1:21" />Kun waco ni, “Yam abino nono nia ki i i maa, dok abidok bene nono. Rwot ceng omiyo, ci Rwot otyeko kwanyo gire; kipwo nying Rwot.”<verse eid="JOB 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 1:22" />Ikom lok magi ducu, Yubu pe obalo, dok pe owaco ni Lubanga otime rac.<verse eid="JOB 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOB 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 2:1" />Inino mo mukene ma lumalaika pa Lubanga dok gubino gucung inyim Rwot, ci Catan bene obino ikin gi kacungu inyim Rwot. <verse eid="JOB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 2:2" />Rwot dok openyo Catan ni, “In ia ki kwene?” Catan ogamo dog Rwot kun waco ni, “An aa kawire iwi lobo, ki kawot ikin piny i lobo.” <verse eid="JOB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 2:3" />Ci Rwot dok openyo Catan ni, “Itye katamo pi latica Yubu, ni pe tye ngat mo macalo en iwi lobo, dano ma peke ki bal mo, dano ma cwinye leng, ma lworo Lubanga, dok dag tim maracu? En pud ocung matek labongo bal mo, kadi bed ipiya ikome wek ityeke woko labongo tyen lok mo.” <verse eid="JOB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 2:4" />Catan ogamo dog Rwot kun waco ni, “Del pi del! Gin ducu ma dano tye kwede en bimiyo pi kwone. <verse eid="JOB 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 2:5" />Ento tek iketo cingi ikome, iwano cogone ki ringo kome, ci en yeti cut ki inyimi.” <verse eid="JOB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 2:6" />Ci Rwot owaco bot Catan ni, “Nen, en dong tye itweroni; ento myero igwok kwone keken.”<verse eid="JOB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 2:7" />Kumeno Catan oa ocito woko ki inyim Rwot, ocako yelo Yubu ki bur maracu ma oonyo cake ki i dye tyene nio kwede wa i cwiny wiye. <verse eid="JOB 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 2:8" />Ci en okwanyo labalatek me cwero kome, ka ocito obedo iwi odur i buru. <verse eid="JOB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 2:9" />Ma omiyo dakone owace ni, “Pud ibicung matek ma pe ibalo bal mo? Yet Lubanga, wek ito woko.”<verse eid="JOB 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 2:10" />Ento Yubu ogamo dog dakone ni, “In aye iloko lok macalo mon maming ma pe gingeyo Lubanga. Wabigamo gin maber ki i cing Lubanga, ci pe wagamo gin marac?” I can magi ducu Yubu pe obalo ki doge.<verse eid="JOB 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lurem Yubu gubino bote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 2:11" />Ka lurem Yubu adek guwinyo pi gin maracu magi ducu ma obino ikome gubino kun ngat man a ki i kabedone, Erifaji Lateman, Bildad Lacua ki Jopar Lanaamat. Kumeno gurwate kacel wek gunyut cwercwinygi bot Yubu ki me kweyo cwinye bene. <verse eid="JOB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 2:12" />Ka guilo wanggi ma pud gitye kamabor, ci pe guniang maber ka dano ma ginenoni aye Yubu. Ento ka guniang ikome, ci gucako koko ki dwon malongo, guyeco wa jorgi ki bene gujuku wigi ki ngom. <verse eid="JOB 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 2:13" />Lacen gubedo piny i ngom gurii bote nino abiro dyeceng ki dyewor, ngat mo ma oloko kwede obedo peke, pien guneno ni arem ma ikome onongo dit mada.<verse eid="JOB 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOB 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yubu obedo ki nguru bot Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 20:14-18">Jer 20:14-18</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Olo twal Yubu ongamo doge, oceno nino mayam kinywale iye.<verse eid="JOB 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Yubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 3:2" />Yubu owaco ni,<verse eid="JOB 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 3:3" />“Wek nino mayam kinywala iye ki cen woko matwal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:3">ki wor mayam maa ogama i ic</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:3">bene ki cen woko.<verse eid="JOB 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 3:4" />Wek nino meno obed macol!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:4">Lubanga matye malo pe otam pire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:4">lengpiny mo bene pe omeny nino meno.<verse eid="JOB 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 3:5" />Wek mutu ki piny ma ocido licuc aye ogam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:5">Wek pol obed iwiye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:5">cido piny me dyeceng bene omiye lworo.<verse eid="JOB 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 3:6" />Wek piny ma ocido licuc omak wor meno,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:6">wek kijwar wor meno woko ki ikin nino me mwaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:6">wek pe bene kikwan ikin nino dwe.<verse eid="JOB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 3:7" />Eyo, wek wor meno obed lalur,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:7">dwon dange me yomcwiny pe owinye iye.<verse eid="JOB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 3:8" />Wek jo ma giceno nino gucen nino meno,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:8">gin jo ma gitwero lwongo Min Kulu.<verse eid="JOB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 3:9" />Wek lakalatwe me kwarpiny gudok col,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:9">wek okur lengpiny ento pe onong,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:9">wek pe bene onen wang ceng me odiko;<verse eid="JOB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 3:10" />pien wor meno pe oloro ot nyodo pa maa woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:10">omiyo alimo ayelayela man.<verse eid="JOB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 3:11" />Pingo pe ato woko ikare me nywala?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:11">Pingo kwona pe otum cut ka aa ki i ic?<verse eid="JOB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 3:12" />Pingo yam maa otinga i eme?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:12">Pingo tunune ogama, wek adote?<verse eid="JOB 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 3:13" />Onongo kono ceng abutu piny mot lilwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:13">kono anino, dok kono onongo atye kayweyo,<verse eid="JOB 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 3:14" />kacel ki luker ki luryeko me lobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:14">mayam guroco odi me gang ker ma gudong iwi odur,<verse eid="JOB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 3:15" />nyo ki rwodi mayam gitye ki lonyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:15">ma gupongo odigi ki lim.<verse eid="JOB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 3:16" />Pingo yam pe abedo macalo latin abwoga ma kikano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:16">macalo latin ma pe oneno dero ceng?<verse eid="JOB 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 3:17" />Ki i bur lyel kunu jo maracu pe dong gikelo ayela,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:17">ki kunu jo ma guol gitye kayweyo.<verse eid="JOB 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 3:18" />Kunu mabuc gibedo mot kacel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:18">ma pe dong giwinyo dwon ladit tic mo.<verse eid="JOB 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 3:19" />Jo matino ki ludito gitye kunu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:19">opii nongo kigonyogi woko ki i twer pa rwotgi.<verse eid="JOB 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 3:20" />Pingo kimiyo lengpiny bot ngat matye ki can,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:20">pingo kimiyo kwo bot jo ma cwinygi kec?<verse eid="JOB 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 3:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 9:6">Niy 9:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Giparo pi to, ento to pe bino,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:21">giyenyo pire makato pi lim mukane ducu.<verse eid="JOB 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 3:22" />Jo meno cwinygi pe kwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:22">cwinygi bibedo yom ka kiyikogi i lyel.<verse eid="JOB 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 3:23" />Pingo kimiyo dero bot dano ma pe neno wangayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:23">ma Lubanga orume ki cel?<verse eid="JOB 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 3:24" />Pien cura dong odoko calo kwon ma acamo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:24">dok bene pe atwero giko cur.<verse eid="JOB 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 3:25" />Pien gin ma alworoni dong obino ikoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:25">ki gin ma alworo ma okato kare dong opoto ikoma.<verse eid="JOB 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 3:26" />Kuc mo peke bota, kadi wa yweyo bene peke;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:26">pe atye ki kuc, ento ayelayela keken.”<verse eid="JOB 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOB 4" />
  <para style="s1">Erifaji ojuku Yubu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 4:1" />Erifaji Lateman ogamo doge ni,<verse eid="JOB 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 4:2" />“Ka ngat mo otemo lok kwedi, ibijul?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:2">Ento anga matwero juke wek owek lok?<verse eid="JOB 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 4:3" />Nen, in ibedo kapwonyo jo mapol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:3">ki ibedo kakonyo jo ma lukonygi peke.<verse eid="JOB 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 4:4" />Dano ma oyoke mito poto woko ki i niyene, in yam icuku cwinye ki loki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:4">kun ibedo kacuku cwiny dano ma ool wek obed matek.<verse eid="JOB 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 4:5" />Ento kombedi can dong obino ikomi, ci pe idiyo cwinyi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:5">ogudi, ci dong ibange woko.<verse eid="JOB 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 4:6" />Lworoni ikom Lubanga pe kwanyo par woko ki i cwinyi mono?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:6">Cwinyi ma lengi pe miyo in ibedo ki gen?<verse eid="JOB 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 4:7" />Kong itam mono, anga ma peke ki bal mayam oto?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:7">Jo ma cwinygi leng kinekogi ki kakwene?<verse eid="JOB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 4:8" />Macalo atyeko nenone, dano ma gipuru bal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:8">kun gicoyo ayelayela macalo kodi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:8">gin aye gikayo bene kit gin acelu.<verse eid="JOB 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 4:9" />Gito ki yamo yweyo pa Lubanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:9">aluu dog Lubanga mamwoc kinigane tyekogi woko.<verse eid="JOB 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 4:10" />Jo ma kitgi racu gibwaro calo labwor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:10">ento Lubanga miyo dwon gi ling woko ci turu lakgi woko.<verse eid="JOB 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 4:11" />Macalo labwor matek ma to, pien gin ma en dwaro dong peke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:11">kitmeno gin bene bito ci lutinogi biket woko ata.<verse eid="JOB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 4:12" />Yam kikelo lok bota i mung,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:12">ita owinyo ka kikwilo akwila.<verse eid="JOB 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 4:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 33:15">Yub 33:15</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Man obino iwiya macalo lek ma yelo dano i dyewor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:13">i cawa ma dano nino matek.<verse eid="JOB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 4:14" />Lworo madwong obino ikoma, ki myelkom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:14">omiyo cogona ducu oyenge.<verse eid="JOB 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 4:15" />Yamo mo manok okodo i wanga, ci yer koma ducu oa.<verse eid="JOB 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 4:16" />Lacen ocung mot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:16">ento pe apoko kit manen kwede.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:16">Cal gin mo onongo tye inyima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:16">piny oling woko litik;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:16">lacen awinyo dwon ma waco ni,<verse eid="JOB 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 4:17" />‘Tika dano ma to wokoni bedo ma kite atir inyim Lubanga?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:17">Dano twero bedo ma olonye inyim Lacwece?<verse eid="JOB 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 4:18" />Ka Lubanga pe geno kadi wa lutice ma i polo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:18">kadi wa lumalaikane bene en nongo bal ikomgi,<verse eid="JOB 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 4:19" />ci dong dano kono ma kome tye loboni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:19">ma gutine aye kweyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:19">ma kinyotogi macalo nyenye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:19">gibedo ningning?<verse eid="JOB 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 4:20" />Gitwero bedo kwo odiko ento otyeno gito woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:20">girwenyo matwal kun ngat ma paro pirgi peke.<verse eid="JOB 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 4:21" />Gito woko oyot, ma peya gunongo ryeko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:21">macalo kema poto ka gigonyo tole.’<verse eid="JOB 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOB 5" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 5:1" />Yubu lwong lwongo kombedi ci i nen ka ngat mo bidoki iye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:1">Ibiloke bot lamalaika mo bo wek okonyi?<verse eid="JOB 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 5:2" />Atika, cwercwiny miyo laming to,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:2">dok nyeko neko dano ma tame nok.<verse eid="JOB 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 5:3" />Atyeko neno laming ma olony matek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:3">ento oyotoyot kiceno kabedone woko.<verse eid="JOB 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 5:4" />Kakane peke pi lutinone;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:4">kidiyogi woko i dog gang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:4">ma nongo ngat ma larogi dong peke.<verse eid="JOB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 5:5" />Cam ma en okayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:5">dano ma kec nekogi gicamo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:5">kun gikwanyo wa ikin okutu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:5">pi mitigi madwong gilaro lonyone alara.<verse eid="JOB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 5:6" />Pien can pe a ki i apwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:6">ki ayelayela bene pe twi ki i ngom.<verse eid="JOB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 5:7" />Wan dano kinywalowa i can,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:7">kit macalo mac kir cito malo.<verse eid="JOB 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 5:8" />Kono nene an aye in, kono ayenyo kony ki bot Lubanga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:8">Ci onongo aketo loka i cinge.<verse eid="JOB 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 5:9" />En tiyo tic madito ma tere pe tate,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:9">tice me aura ma welgi pe kwane.<verse eid="JOB 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 5:10" />En miyo kot cwer iwi lobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:10">dok cwalo pii i olet.<verse eid="JOB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 5:11" />En keto jo matye piny i kabedo mamalo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:11">tingo jo ma kumu, cibogi malo kama ber.<verse eid="JOB 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 5:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 3:19">1 Kor 3:19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>En balo tam pa luryeko me goba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:12">wek pe gucob ticgi kakare.<verse eid="JOB 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 5:13" />En mako lungol ryeko i ryekogi ken gi, macalo owic,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:13">ci yub pa jo ma tamgi ogom bale woko oyot.<verse eid="JOB 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 5:14" />Gin donyo i colpiny i dyeceng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:14">gipange apanga i cwiny dyeceng macalo i dyewor.<verse eid="JOB 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 5:15" />Ento en laro jo ma piny obwoyogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:15">ki i lok dog jo maracu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:15">ci kwanyogi woko ki i cing jo matego.<verse eid="JOB 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 5:16" />Lubanga miyo lucan gibedo ki gen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:16">ki jo maracu kimiyo doggi woko.<verse eid="JOB 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 5:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 3:11">Car 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:5-6">Ibru 12:5-6</ref></char>
    </note>Tye ki yomcwiny, dano ma Lubanga juku;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:17">pimeno pe ikwer pwony pa Won Twer Ducu.<verse eid="JOB 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 5:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 6:1">Koc 6:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kadi bed Lubanga miyo ret,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:18">en bene tweyo wang bur. En goyo dano, ci cango woko bene.<verse eid="JOB 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 5:19" />En bilari ikom ayelayela abicel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:19">kadi wa i me abirone bene gin marac mo pe bigudi.<verse eid="JOB 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 5:20" />Ikare me kec en pe biweki i to,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:20">ki i mony en bilari miyo pe kineki.<verse eid="JOB 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 5:21" />En bikani ki i leb me anywar,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:21">pe ibilworo layak ka obino.<verse eid="JOB 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 5:22" />Ikare me kec cam ki tim gerogero ibinyero anyera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:22">dok pe ibilworo lee tim.<verse eid="JOB 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 5:23" />Pien potini bibedo labongo gweng mo iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:23">ki lee tim mo pe bimaki.<verse eid="JOB 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 5:24" />Ibingeyo ni kemani tye maber,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:24">ka ibingiyo dwoli, ci ibinongo romini ducu tye kakare.<verse eid="JOB 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 5:25" />Ibibedo ki likwayu mapol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:25">lutinoni ma inywalo bibedo madwong calo lum ma i tim.<verse eid="JOB 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 5:26" />Ibito ma dong itii maber,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:26">macalo ngano ma kitero i laro kadinone ka karene oromo.<verse eid="JOB 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 5:27" />Nen, watyeko yenyo telok man ci wanongo ni tye me ada.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:27">Winy, ci wek bene okonyi.”<verse eid="JOB 5:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOB 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yubu ojuku luwote</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 6:1" />Yubu odok iye kun waco ni,<verse eid="JOB 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 6:2" />“Kono ceng kipimo cwercwinya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:2">kono kiporo i mijan kit can ma opoto ikoma!<verse eid="JOB 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 6:3" />Pien kono obedo pek makato kweyo dog nam;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:3">en gin ma omiyo ceng aloko lok atata.<verse eid="JOB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 6:4" />Atero pa Wontwer ducu dong otucu koma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:4">kwirgi tye kanya kaducu ikoma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:4">Lubanga dong okelo ikoma kit tice ducu makelo lworo.<verse eid="JOB 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 6:5" />Itamoni kana me tim kok ka en tye ki lum idoge?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:5">Dok itamoni twon dyang kok ka kiketo came inyime?<verse eid="JOB 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 6:6" />Itamoni gin mabot twero came labongo kado?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:6">Dok itamoni pig otigo lwaka bile mamit labongo kado?<verse eid="JOB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 6:7" />Iya pe mito wa bilone;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:7">gin calo cam ma lemo cwinya.<verse eid="JOB 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 6:8" />Ka nene Lubanga omiya gin ma alego bote,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:8">ka nene omiya gin ma cwinya mito.<verse eid="JOB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 6:9" />Dok kono Lubanga oneka woko cut;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:9">kono oweko cinge otiyo tice me neka woko.<verse eid="JOB 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 6:10" />Ka kono otimo kumeno, kono cwinya okwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:10">kono apye ki yomcwiny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:10">kadi bed arem me koma dwong ma pe wace;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:10">pien onongo yam pe akwero lok ma Ngat Maleng owaco.<verse eid="JOB 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 6:11" />Atye ki teko ango ma miya pud abedo kwo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:11">Agiki me kwona bibedo ningning wek adii cwinya?<verse eid="JOB 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 6:12" />Tekona rom ki teko me got mono?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:12">Ringo koma rom ki mola ce?<verse eid="JOB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 6:13" />I ada pe atye ki kero me konye pira kena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:13">jami ducu ma konya dong kikwanyo woko ki bota.<verse eid="JOB 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 6:14" />Ngat ma pe timo kica ki lawote ikare ma kit man,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:14">nongo dong oweko lworo Lubanga woko.<verse eid="JOB 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 6:15" />Luwota bwola macalo ora kulu ma opong,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:15">ma piine mol woko, ci two woko oyot.<verse eid="JOB 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 6:16" />Piine col pien orube ki daba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:16">daba ma mol a ki iwi got malo.<verse eid="JOB 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 6:17" />Ikare me oro piine rwenyo woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:17">ka piny odoko lyet ci pe dok nen.<verse eid="JOB 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 6:18" />Luwot weko yoogi, ci giwire ata i dye tim pi yenyo pii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:18">gicoro dye tim, ci gito woko i dye aroo.<verse eid="JOB 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 6:19" />Luwot ma gua ki i Tema guciko wanggi me neno lakit kulu meno,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:19">jo ma gua ki i Ceba gumoko gen gi ikome.<verse eid="JOB 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 6:20" />Gubedo ki gen madwong ento gen gi obale nono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:20">ka guo kunu, ci lewic omakogi.<verse eid="JOB 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 6:21" />Wun ki tung bota wurom ki laora kulu meno;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:21">wuneno can ma opoto ikoma, ci lworo omakowu cut.<verse eid="JOB 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 6:22" />Onongo yam alego gin mo ki tung botwu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:22">Yam kong onongo awaco botwu ni wumii limwu me wilo ngat mo me konya?<verse eid="JOB 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 6:23" />Nyo awaco ni wulara ki i cing lakwora?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:23">Nyo ni wukoka ki i cing jo ma gitye kauna?<verse eid="JOB 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 6:24" />Ber wupwonya, ci abiling woko litik;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:24">wunyuta bal ma apoto iye.<verse eid="JOB 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 6:25" />Lok matye atir donyo i cwiny dano!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:25">Ento gin ango ma omiyo wujuka?<verse eid="JOB 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 6:26" />Wun wutamo ni wutwero juku loka woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:26">pien wutamo ni loka obedo calo yamo nono.<verse eid="JOB 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 6:27" />Onongo bene wutwero bolo kwir ikom lutino kic,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:27">nyo wutwero laro wel ikom luremwu wek gudok gin acata pi lim.<verse eid="JOB 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 6:28" />Ento koni wutim ber, wunen wanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:28">pien pe abiloko lok goba ki inyimwu.<verse eid="JOB 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 6:29" />Wuwek dong meno obed ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:29">wuwek ngolo kop ikoma ma pe atir.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:29">Wulok tamwu, pien kop pe twero loya.<verse eid="JOB 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 6:30" />Pud wutamo ni aloko lok goba?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:30">Wutamo ni an pe aromo poko gin maber ki gin marac?<verse eid="JOB 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOB 7" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 7:1" />Kwo me lobo man tek calo tic matek pa lumony;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:1">dano tyeko karene macalo lapakaca.<verse eid="JOB 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 7:2" />En cal ki opii ma paro bedo i tipu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:2">rom ki lapakaca ma kuru gamo mucarane.<verse eid="JOB 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 7:3" />Kumeno an bene kimiya lwak dwe mapol labongo gin atima mo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:3">dyewor ki dyewor kela cwercwiny keken.<verse eid="JOB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 7:4" />Ka abutu piny apenyo ni, ‘Abia malo awene?’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:4">Ento dyewor rii nakanaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:4">kun abedo kapwode apwoda nio wa okokgweno.<verse eid="JOB 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 7:5" />Kwidi ki cilo ma odile kacel oboyo koma woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:5">del koma orobo woko ci dok cwer tut.<verse eid="JOB 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 7:6" />Nino acel acel kato madwir makato yat cweyo bongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:6">ci tum woko kun weka labongo gen mo.<verse eid="JOB 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 7:7" />Lubanga, po ni kwona rom ki aluu ma mwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:7">wanga pe dok bineno gin maber wa ki acel.<verse eid="JOB 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 7:8" />Ngat ma wange dong onena pe binena doki;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:8">ibiciko wangi pi nena, ci inongo ni an dong apeke.<verse eid="JOB 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 7:9" />Macalo pol ket ci pe dok nen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:9">kitmeno ngat ma oto cito piny i lyel pe dong dwogo cen.<verse eid="JOB 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 7:10" />En pe dok i ode doki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:10">kadi wa jo ma gingeye pe dong gipo pire.<verse eid="JOB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 7:11" />Kumeno pe dok abijuku doga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:11">Awinyo arem i cwinya, ci myero aloki;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:11">myero akok ki nguru, pien iya kec.<verse eid="JOB 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 7:12" />An abedo Nam bo, nyo Min Kulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:12">ma omiyo iketo lakurpiny me kura?<verse eid="JOB 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 7:13" />Ka awaco ni, ‘Kabutuna bikweyo cwinya,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:13">nyo ni, ‘Arem koma bikwe ka abutu piny,’<verse eid="JOB 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 7:14" />ento in iryango koma ki lwak lek ma bino iwiya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:14">imiyo lworo maka matek pi gin ma aneno dyewor i wang lek,<verse eid="JOB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 7:15" />man omiyo cwinya mito ni twora dong kideya woko!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:15">Twora ma ato loyo me bedo ki arem man.<verse eid="JOB 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 7:16" />Adag bedo kit man; pe amito kwo nakanaka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:16">In iwek abedi, pien nino me kwona odong manok mo keken.<verse eid="JOB 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 7:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 8:4">Jab 8:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 144:3">144:3</ref></char>
    </note>Dano obedo gin ango, ma omiyo pire bedo tek botini?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:17">Pingo iketo cwinyi ikome kuman?<verse eid="JOB 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 7:18" />Ibedo kalime odiko ki odiko, kun iteme teretere.<verse eid="JOB 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 7:19" />Ibibedo kanena pi kare marom mene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:19">ma pe iloko wangi ineno cen kamukeneni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:19">Pe kong iweka kare manok mo ma roma mwonyo laa keken?<verse eid="JOB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 7:20" />Ka abalo, ci atimo gin ango ikomi, in ma ipiro wangi kaneno gin ma dano ducu tiyoni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:20">Pingo ibaya ki tongi kare ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:20">macalo dano ma pwonyo lweny?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:20">Pingo adoko calo yec mapek boti?<verse eid="JOB 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 7:21" />Pingo pe itima kica pi roca?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:21">Dok pe ijwayo bala woko pingo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:21">Pien koni dong kibiyika ilyel; ci ibiyenya ento pe ibinonga.”<verse eid="JOB 7:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOB 8" />
  <para style="s1">Bildad ocuku cwiny Yubu me ngut</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 8:1" />Bildad Lacua ogamo dog Yubu kun waco ni,<verse eid="JOB 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 8:2" />“Lok magi ibiloko nio wa awene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:2">kun loki winye calo yamo madit ma kodo matek?<verse eid="JOB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 8:3" />Itamoni Lubanga pe ngolo kop atir?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:3">Itamoni Won Twer Ducu timo gin ma pe kakare?<verse eid="JOB 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 8:4" />Nen, lutinoni gwok gubedo katimo bal ikome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:4">ma oweko en omiyo can opoto ikomgi ma oporo balgi.<verse eid="JOB 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 8:5" />Ka ibiyenyo Lubanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:5">kun ibako dogi bot Won Twer Ducu,<verse eid="JOB 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 8:6" />ka ii leng ma cwinyi atir, adada ci Lubanga bikonyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:6">bidwoko jamini ducu kakare pi kiti ma atir.<verse eid="JOB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 8:7" />Kadi bed yam i acaki ibedo ki jami manok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:7">ento i agiki me kwoni ibibedo ki lim mabup.<verse eid="JOB 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 8:8" />Pieno alegi, peny kwariwa macon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:8">ci itam gin ango mayam kwarigi gubedo kayenyo ci gupwonye iye;<verse eid="JOB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 8:9" />pien wan wabedo jo ma laworo keken,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:9">pe wangeyo gin mo, ninowa me bedo i lobo loke calo tipu yat.<verse eid="JOB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 8:10" />Dong iwiny pwony pa ludongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:10">ki lok ma gipwonyo pi ngecgi matut.<verse eid="JOB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 8:11" />Itamoni togo twero dongo kama dogkulu pe iye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:11">Opiro<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="fk">Opiro </char> obedo lum madongo idog kulu, en cal ki pitpit. </note> twero dongo kama pii peke iye?<verse eid="JOB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 8:12" />Ka pud gilot alota, ma peya kitongogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:12">giner woko oyot makato ginapita ducu ka gitye kama pii peke iye.<verse eid="JOB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 8:13" />Meno aye yo pa jo ducu ma wigi wil woko ikom Lubanga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:13">ki gen pa dano ma pe lworo Lubanga bitum.<verse eid="JOB 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 8:14" />Gin ma en geno rom ki uci ma cod woko oyotoyot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:14">nyo rom ki obwo oboropyen.<verse eid="JOB 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 8:15" />En jenge ikom jamine, ento jamine pe konye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:15">en keto gene ikom jamine, ma pe cung mateki.<verse eid="JOB 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 8:16" />En rom ki doo ma lot matek ka ceng pe ryeny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:16">ma jange lak, rumu poto woko.<verse eid="JOB 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 8:17" />Lwite odwale ikom odur gweng, ci mako liking.<verse eid="JOB 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 8:18" />Ka kiputu woko ki kakare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:18">kabedone bikwere woko, kun waco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:18">‘An yam peya aneni,’<verse eid="JOB 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 8:19" />Ada doo mukene twi i ngom leyo kakare cut.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:19">Meno aye yomcwiny pa dano ma pe lworo Lubanga.<verse eid="JOB 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 8:20" />Nen, Lubanga pe bikwero dano ma peke ki bal;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:20">dok en pe miyo kony bot jo maracu.<verse eid="JOB 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 8:21" />En pud bimiyo dogi pong ki nyero,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:21">miyo ibidongo oduru me yomcwiny.<verse eid="JOB 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 8:22" />Lewic bimako jo ma dagi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:22">ki kema pa lutim maracu pe dok binen.”<verse eid="JOB 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOB 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yubu okok ni lacungu dware peke</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 9:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 4:17">Yub 4:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yubu ogamo ni,<verse eid="JOB 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 9:2" />“Adada angeyo ni tye kitmeno;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:2">ento dano twero loyo kop ningning inyim Lubanga?<verse eid="JOB 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 9:3" />Kace dano mo mito pyem kwede,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:3">ci en twero penyo peny alip acel kulu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:3">ma dano mo pe twero doke iye kadi ki acel.<verse eid="JOB 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 9:4" />Lubanga ryek i cwinye, dok tekone dwong;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:4">anga matye ki tekcwiny maromo loyo en?<verse eid="JOB 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 9:5" />En kobo godi woko ma pe gingeyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:5">dok balogi woko ki kiniga.<verse eid="JOB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 9:6" />En cwalo oyengyeng ci yengo ngom, ci balo pete me lobo woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:6">dok myelo kom wir me te lobo ducu.<verse eid="JOB 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 9:7" />En ciko ceng, miyo pe tuc;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:7">en umu lakalatwe woko i dyewor wek pe guryeny.<verse eid="JOB 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 9:8" />En oyaro polo kene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:8">ka onyono biamwonyi me nam woko.<verse eid="JOB 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 9:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 38:31">Yub 38:31</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 5:8">Amo 5:8</ref></char>
    </note>En aye ma oketo Latwok ki Lyernyim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:9">Yoggo ki lakalatwe ma ginen tung kupiny.<verse eid="JOB 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 9:10" />En tiyo tic madito ma niang iye tek bot dano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:10">ki tic me aura ma welgi pe kwane.<verse eid="JOB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 9:11" />Nen, Lubanga kato ki ingeta, kun pe aneno;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:11">dok en mede ki wot anyim, ento an pe angeyo.<verse eid="JOB 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 9:12" />En kwanyo jami ma iye mito cito kwede woko anga matwero juke?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:12">Anga matwero penyo en ni, ‘Itimo ango?’<verse eid="JOB 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 9:13" />Lubanga pe bijuku kinigane;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:13">wa lukony pa Rakab, ma min kulu bene, gibedo ki myelkom inyime.<verse eid="JOB 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 9:14" />Kara man atwero gamo doge ningning,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:14">nyo yero lok ma abipido kwede inyime?<verse eid="JOB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 9:15" />Kadi bed bala peke, pe atwero gamo doge;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:15">myero aleg ngat ma dota wek otima kica keken.<verse eid="JOB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 9:16" />Kace nene ogamo doga ikare ma alwonge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:16">kono pe aye ni onongo twero winyo loka.<verse eid="JOB 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 9:17" />En bedo kapwoda ki yamo matek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:17">ci medo ret ikoma labongo tyen lok mo.<verse eid="JOB 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 9:18" />En pe ye miya kare me yweyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:18">ento miyo abedo ki keccwiny keken.<verse eid="JOB 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 9:19" />Kace me tekkom, ci Lubanga tek adada!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:19">Kace me pido ci anga matwero lwonge kapido?<verse eid="JOB 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 9:20" />Kadi bed bala peke, ento lok ma aloko miyo kop loya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:20">kadi bed bala peke, en pud twero miyo anen calo dano ma labal.<verse eid="JOB 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 9:21" />An bala peke, ento pe dong aparo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:21">dong aol ki bedo makwo.<verse eid="JOB 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 9:22" />Loke ducu dong rom aroma; en ma omiyo awaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:22">Lubanga tyeko jo ducu, jo ma obalo ki jo ma pe gubalo.<verse eid="JOB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 9:23" />Ka can mo opoto ikom jo ma peke ki bal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:23">ci en nyero mere anyera.<verse eid="JOB 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 9:24" />Lubanga miyo lobo i cing jo maracu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:24">kun umu wang lungolkop woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:24">ka pe en aye timo, ci anga kono?<verse eid="JOB 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 9:25" />Nino me kwona ringo oyotoyot kato langwec woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:25">gilwi girwenyo woko, pe gineno gin mo maber.<verse eid="JOB 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 9:26" />Gicito oyot calo yeya ma kitiyo ki togo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:26">calo ocur ma lyane ikom lee ma en dwaro.<verse eid="JOB 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 9:27" />Ka atamo ni, ‘Wiya biwil woko ikom pekona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:27">abibedo ki yomcwiny kun abunyu abunya,’<verse eid="JOB 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 9:28" />ci pud dok abedo ki lworo pi arem ducu ma atye kwede,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:28">pien angeyo ni ibitera macalo dano ma labal.<verse eid="JOB 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 9:29" />Macalo dong ingolo ni kop oloya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:29">ayele kono dong pingo?<verse eid="JOB 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 9:30" />Kadi bed alwoke ki pee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:30">kadi bed alwok cinga ki cabun,<verse eid="JOB 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 9:31" />pud ibibola i bur aye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:31">ci bongina bikwero koma woko.<verse eid="JOB 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 9:32" />Lubanga gire pe dano calo an, ma myero agam doge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:32">kono obedo dano, kono wapido kwede.<verse eid="JOB 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 9:33" />Ngat mo peke matwero ngolo lok ikinwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:33">ma myero ongol kop ikomwa wan aryo ducu.<verse eid="JOB 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 9:34" />Ka onongo Lubanga pe opwoda ki odoone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:34">dok pe omiyo koma oryange me lworo en,<verse eid="JOB 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 9:35" />kono onongo atwero lok labongo lworo mo inyime,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:35">pien angeyo ni pe atye kit ma jo mogo gitamo kwede.<verse eid="JOB 9:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOB 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yubu okok ni kwone konye peke</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 10:1" />Adag dong kwona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:1">pimeno pe abijuku kokona;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:1">abiloko lok ducu, pien cwinya dong odoko kec.<verse eid="JOB 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 10:2" />Abiwaco bot Lubanga ni, ‘Pe ingol kop oloya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:2">ento tita gin ma omiyo itye kakelo lok ikoma.’<verse eid="JOB 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 10:3" />Nen ber ki boti me bedo kauna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:3">ki cayo tic ma in dong itiyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:3">kun nongo cwinyi yom pi tim pa jo maracu?<verse eid="JOB 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 10:4" />Nenoni rom ki neno pa dano?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:4">Ngeci rom ki ngec pa dano?<verse eid="JOB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 10:5" />Wel nino me kwoni rom ki pa dano?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:5">Ibiri pi mwaka manok calo dano,<verse eid="JOB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 10:6" />ma omiyo itye kayenyo bal ikoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:6">wek inen kama bala tye iye?<verse eid="JOB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 10:7" />In kikomi ingeyo ni an pe abalo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:7">dok ni pe tye dano mo matwero lara ki i cingi.<verse eid="JOB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 10:8" />In yam icweya ki cingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:8">ci koni dong iloke, imito neka?<verse eid="JOB 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 10:9" />Po ni yam icweya ki lobo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:9">ci dok ibidwoka i apwa aye?<verse eid="JOB 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 10:10" />Ceng pe in aye imiyo wora kero me nywala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:10">ci imiyo adongo i ot nyodo pa maa?<verse eid="JOB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 10:11" />In ceng iumu koma ki del ki ringo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:11">dok ikubu cogona kacel ki ler.<verse eid="JOB 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 10:12" />Imiyo bota kwo ki mar meri ma pe loke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:12">ci yeleni pira, ki gwok ma meri oweko akwo.<verse eid="JOB 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 10:13" />Ento onongo ikano lok macalo man i cwinyi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:13">dong aniang ni gin ma otimeni onongo ityeko yubu con.<verse eid="JOB 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 10:14" />Onongo ibedo kakiya kaneno ka apoto i bal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:14">wek pe i ye weko bala mo wa ki acel.<verse eid="JOB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 10:15" />Ka atimo gin marac ci dong nongo apoto woko ipeko!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:15">Ento kadi bala peke, pe atwero tingo wanga malo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:15">pien lewic maka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:15">pi can ma obwoya woko.<verse eid="JOB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 10:16" />Kace gum ocako bino bota, ci in itugi dwara cut macalo labwor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:16">ci itiyo tic me aura me kelo can ikoma.<verse eid="JOB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 10:17" />In ibedo kakelo cadeni manyen pi nyutu bala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:17">kinigani mede ameda ikoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:17">kun ikelo buca mony manyen ka lweny ikoma.<verse eid="JOB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 10:18" />Pingo iweko aa ki i maa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:18">Kono ceng anguku to ma peya wang dano onena, kono ber.<verse eid="JOB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 10:19" />Kono ceng kitinga nia ki i ic kitera wa i bur lyel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:19">kono onongo obedo ber marom ki ngat ma pe yam obedo kwo.<verse eid="JOB 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 10:20" />Nino me kwona pe odong manok keken?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:20">Weka mot, wek kong abed ki yomcwiny manok,<verse eid="JOB 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 10:21" />ma peya acito kama pe dong abidwogo ki iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:21">i lobo me mutu ki piny macol licuc.<verse eid="JOB 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 10:22" />I lobo me colpiny ma onyobe atata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:22">kama dero rom ki colpiny.”<verse eid="JOB 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOB 11" />
  <para style="s1">Jopar owaco ni Yubu labal</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 11:1" />Jopar ma Lanaamat ogamo ni,<verse eid="JOB 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 11:2" />“Lwak lok mapol marom meno pe kigamo ce?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:2">Lalok mapol aye ma loke tye atir ce?<verse eid="JOB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 11:3" />Dog dano myero otwo woko pi loki ma tere pekeni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:3">Iloko lok me ngala, ci ngat mo pe twero weko lewic maki?<verse eid="JOB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 11:4" />Pien iwaco ni, ‘Kita tye maleng, iwang Lubanga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:4">dok lok ma aloko tye me ada.’<verse eid="JOB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 11:5" />Ento kono Lubanga ongamo doge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:5">ci oloko kwedi,<verse eid="JOB 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 11:6" />kono oyabo boti mung mapol me ryekone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:6">pien kitwero neno ryeko i yo mapatpat.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:6">Myero inge ni can ma Lubanga oketo ikomi pe oporo bali ducu.<verse eid="JOB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 11:7" />In itamo ni itwero niang ryeko ki dit pa Lubanga?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:7">Itamo ni itwero nongo kama twero pa Won Twer Ducu gik iye?<verse eid="JOB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 11:8" />Tye malo makato polo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:8">in itwero timo iye gin ango?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:8">Tut makato lyel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:8">in ingeyo iye gin ango?<verse eid="JOB 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 11:9" />Dit pa Lubanga bor makato lobo ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:9">dok lac makato nam.<verse eid="JOB 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 11:10" />Ka en obino ci omako dano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:10">ce olwonge kapido, ci anga matwero juke?<verse eid="JOB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 11:11" />Lubanga ngeyo jo ma konygi peke;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:11">ka oneno bal, ci pe keto iye cwinye?<verse eid="JOB 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 11:12" />Ento dano ma laming binongo ryeko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:12">ka kana me tim onywalo dano.<verse eid="JOB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 11:13" />Kono ibedo ki cwiny maber, kono itango cingi bote!<verse eid="JOB 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 11:14" />Ka yam itimo tim marac, pe dong imede kwede;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:14">pe iwek jo ma i odi gutim gin mo marac.<verse eid="JOB 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 11:15" />Ci adada ibibedo labongo lewic mo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:15">dok ibicung matek, ma pe ibilworo gin mo.<verse eid="JOB 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 11:16" />Wii biwil ikom can ma meri;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:16">bibedo boti mucalo pii ma dong omol ocito woko.<verse eid="JOB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 11:17" />Kwoni bibedo kamaleng makato cwiny dyeceng;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:17">kadi bed itye i piny macol ci bibedo macalo rupiny.<verse eid="JOB 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 11:18" />In dong ibibedo ma cwinyi opye, kun ingeyo ni nyimi leng;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:18">ibiywe mot ki kuc kun Lubanga tye kagwoki.<verse eid="JOB 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 11:19" />Ibibutu piny, ci ngat mo pe bimiyi lworo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:19">jo mapol gibibino boti wek ginong gum ki boti.<verse eid="JOB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 11:20" />Ento piny biloyo jo maracu matwal;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:20">pe gibinongo kakane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:20">gen gi tye acel keken en aye ni to tye kabino.”<verse eid="JOB 11:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOB 12" />
  <para style="s1">Yubu ogamo ni edoko gin anyera</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 12:1" />Yubu ogamo ni,<verse eid="JOB 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 12:2" />“Adada wun jo matye ki ngec,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:2">ka wuto, ci ryeko bene birwenyo woko.<verse eid="JOB 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 12:3" />Ento an aniang lok bene macalo wun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:3">wun pe wuryek wuloya wa ki acel.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:3">Anga ma pe ngeyo lok macalo magi?<verse eid="JOB 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 12:4" />Adoko gin anyera bot lurema;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:4">an ma ceng alwongo Lubanga ci en gamo doga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:4">an ma kita atir, ma bal mo peke ikoma, dong adoko gin anyera.<verse eid="JOB 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 12:5" />Lagumkom cayo ngat ma kome kec,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:5">dok goyo ngat ma mito poto.<verse eid="JOB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 12:6" />Kema pa luyak tye ki kuc;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:6">jo mamiyo kiniga mako Lubanga gibedo mot mupye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:6">gin jo ma guloko tekgi odoko lubangagi.<verse eid="JOB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 12:7" />Peny lee, ci gibipwonyi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:7">peny winyo me polo, ci gibititi.<verse eid="JOB 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 12:8" />Gin ma lakalaka ingom gibipwonyi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:8">rec me nam bene gibitucune boti.<verse eid="JOB 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 12:9" />Anga ki ikin gi ducu ma kwiya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:9">ni cing Rwot aye otiyo man?<verse eid="JOB 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 12:10" />Kwo pa gin makwo ducu tye i cinge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:10">aluu me yweyo pa dano acel acel tye itwerone.<verse eid="JOB 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 12:11" />It dano twero niang ikom lok mabeco ki maracu ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:11">macalo dano bilo cam ki lebe.<verse eid="JOB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 12:12" />Ryeko bedo bot jo ma otii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:12">rii iwi lobo miyo dano niang ite lok mapol.<verse eid="JOB 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 12:13" />Lubanga tye ki ryeko dok ki twer;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:13">en tye ki ngec ki niang.<verse eid="JOB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 12:14" />Ka Lubanga omuku ot, ngat mo pe dok gero odoco;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:14">ka Lubanga oloro wi dano, ngat mo pe dok yabo.<verse eid="JOB 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 12:15" />Ka en ojuku kot pe cwer, ci lobo two woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:15">ka en ocwalo pii, ci core iwi lobo.<verse eid="JOB 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 12:16" />En tye ki teko ki ryeko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:16">langak dano ki ngat ma kingako gin ducu gitye ite twero ma mere.<verse eid="JOB 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 12:17" />En kwanyo ryeko pa lumiitam woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:17">ki loko lungolkop miyo gidoko lumingo.<verse eid="JOB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 12:18" />En kwanyo bongo ker woko ki ikom luker,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:18">ci tweyo dura i pyergi macalo opii.<verse eid="JOB 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 12:19" />En kwanyo twero pa ajwakine woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:19">dok miyo wegi twer gipoto.<verse eid="JOB 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 12:20" />En twoyo dog jo mayam kigenogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:20">ci weko gikwiya poko gin maber ki gin marac.<verse eid="JOB 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 12:21" />En weko dano gicayo rwodi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:21">dok kwanyo tek pa wegi twer.<verse eid="JOB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 12:22" />En yabo mung ma okane i piny macol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:22">ci kelo piny macol licuc i dero.<verse eid="JOB 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 12:23" />En miyo rok mukene doko madito, ka dok tyekogi woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:23">miyo rok mukene ginyayo locgi, ka dok tenyogi woko ata.<verse eid="JOB 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 12:24" />En kwanyo ryeko woko ki bot lutela me lobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:24">ci miyo gimal ata i tim kama yoo peke iye.<verse eid="JOB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 12:25" />Gin gileyo cinggi i colpiny labongo dero;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:25">ci miyo gicato macalo lamero.<verse eid="JOB 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOB 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yubu omede ki waco ni cwinye leng</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 13:1" />Nen, wanga oneno magi ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:1">atyeko winyo, ci aniang iye.<verse eid="JOB 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 13:2" />Gin ma wun wungeyo, an bene angeyo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:2">wun pe wuloya wa ki acel.<verse eid="JOB 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 13:3" />Ento kono do amito ni alok ki Won Twer Ducu aye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:3">amito laro loka ki Lubanga.<verse eid="JOB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 13:4" />Wun wuumu lok ada woko ki goba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:4">wun ducu calo ludaktar ma pe konyo.<verse eid="JOB 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 13:5" />Kono onongo wuling alinga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:5">onongo kitwero nenowu ni wun jo maryek.<verse eid="JOB 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 13:6" />Kong mono wuwiny tama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:6">wuter itwu wuwiny loka.<verse eid="JOB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 13:7" />Wun wubiloko lok goba pi Lubanga?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:7">Wun mono wutamo ni lok gobawuni konyo kor Lubanga?<verse eid="JOB 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 13:8" />Wun mono wudoko lucungudwar pa Lubanga?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:8">Wun dong wudoko lupido pire ce?<verse eid="JOB 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 13:9" />Ka Lubanga ongiyowu, ci en tika binongo gin mo maber ma wutiyo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:9">Wutwero bwolo Lubanga kit macalo dano bwolo lawoteni?<verse eid="JOB 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 13:10" />Atikane en bijukuwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:10">ka wucwako kore i mung.<verse eid="JOB 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 13:11" />Dite biryango komwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:11">miyo lworo bimakowu inyime.<verse eid="JOB 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 13:12" />Lok butawuni rom ki buru mamwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:12">lok ma wupido rom ki lobo ma ngide woko oyot.<verse eid="JOB 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 13:13" />Kong wuling mot, ci abilok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:13">wek gin ma mito bino ikoma obin.<verse eid="JOB 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 13:14" />Wek an dong ato woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:14">pien ajalo kwona woko.<verse eid="JOB 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 13:15" />Wek Lubanga oneka gire, pien pe atye ki gen mo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:15">kadi bed kumeno pud abilaro lok kom kita ki inyime.<verse eid="JOB 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 13:16" />Man aye bimiyo aloyo kop,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:16">ni meno dano ma pe lworo Lubanga pe o inyime.<verse eid="JOB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 13:17" />Wuwiny loka mot mupye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:17">wek lok ma atito odony i itwu.<verse eid="JOB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 13:18" />Atyeko yube me pido;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:18">ci angeyo ni abiloyo kop.<verse eid="JOB 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 13:19" />Anga ma bipyem kweda wek obin?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:19">Kace tye, abiling woko ci ato gira.<verse eid="JOB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 13:20" />Alegi lok aryo keken, Lubanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:20">ci ka iye, pe abikane gira ki inyimi:<verse eid="JOB 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 13:21" />pe iwek cingi oguda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:21">dok pe iwek lworo omaka ikomi.<verse eid="JOB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 13:22" />Ci dong ilwonga, ci abigamo dogi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:22">nyo wek akwong lok, ka dong idok iye bota.<verse eid="JOB 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 13:23" />Bala ki roca tye adi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:23">Nyuta tim aranyina.<verse eid="JOB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 13:24" />Pingo dong iloke woko ikoma?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:24">Pingo itera macalo lakwori?<verse eid="JOB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 13:25" />Imito imii lworo omaka ce,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:25">kun arom ki oboke ma yamo kolo wokoni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:25">Iryemo kor cungkal mutwo?<verse eid="JOB 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 13:26" />Pien icoyo lok makec me adot ikoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:26">pud imito ni anen can pi bal me tinona.<verse eid="JOB 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 13:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 33:11">Yub 33:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>In irwako tyena i okol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:27">dok ingiyo kama acito iye ducu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:27">iketo wangacoo kama tyena myero ogik iye.<verse eid="JOB 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 13:28" />Ci omiyo adoko rom ki gin ma otop woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:28">nyo bongo ma nyenye ocamo.<verse eid="JOB 13:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOB 14" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 14:1" />Dano ma dako onywalo nino me kwone nok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:1">dok opong ki ayelayela.<verse eid="JOB 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 14:2" />En dongo macalo ature ci ner woko oyotoyot;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:2">en rwenyo calo tipu yat, pe rii nakanaka.<verse eid="JOB 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 14:3" />Ci in dok iciko wangi ikom ngat macalo meno?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:3">Ikela inyimi wek ingola kop?<verse eid="JOB 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 14:4" />Anga matwero kelo gin maleng ki ikom gin ma pe leng?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:4">Pe tye ngat mo wa ki acel.<verse eid="JOB 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 14:5" />Kityeko ngolo wel nino me kwone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:5">in ingeyo wel dwe ma imiye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:5">ityeko nyutu kama kwone bigik iye ma pe dok kato.<verse eid="JOB 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 14:6" />Lok wangi inen cen, wek en obedi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:6">wek otyek ninone ki kuc macalo latic pi mucara.<verse eid="JOB 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 14:7" />Kadi wa yat bene tye ki gen makato,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:7">ni meno ka kireto piny ci dok binyuru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:7">pud dok bilot aye.<verse eid="JOB 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 14:8" />Kadi lwite dong orii ma otegi i lobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:8">kadi ka ajute yam oto woko i ngom,<verse eid="JOB 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 14:9" />ento teke pii tye i ngom ci bicwiyone woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:9">ci bolo jange calo yat ma pud kipito apita.<verse eid="JOB 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 14:10" />Ento dano ka dong guto pe dong gia malo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:10">ci kwogi dong gik woko matwal.<verse eid="JOB 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 14:11" />Macalo pii tum woko ki i nam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:11">ki kulu dwon two woko,<verse eid="JOB 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 14:12" />kumeno dano bene to woko ci pe dok gia malo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:12">macalo polo bedo mere nakani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:12">gin bene pe gibico ki iwang ninogi.<verse eid="JOB 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 14:13" />Kono onongo ikana i lyel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:13">ci wi owil ikoma nio ka kinigani dong okato,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:13">ci dong iket kare madong ibipo pira iye!<verse eid="JOB 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 14:14" />Ka dano dong oto, pud dok gibidwogo ka kwo odoco?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:14">Ka onongo tye kitmeno, kono adiyo cwinya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:14">kun akuru nino ma omyero kigonya iye ki i cana.<verse eid="JOB 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 14:15" />Ci onongo ibilwonga, ci abigamo dogi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:15">pira bibedo miti mada, pien in aye icweya.<verse eid="JOB 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 14:16" />Ci onongo ibineno kama acito iye ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:16">ento pe ibikiya pi neno bala.<verse eid="JOB 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 14:17" />Onongo ibitweyo bala woko i kicaa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:17">ci ibiumu wi roca ducu.<verse eid="JOB 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 14:18" />Ento got madit poto ci ngide woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:18">pata gikobo woko ki i kakare,<verse eid="JOB 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 14:19" />pii mudu gweng woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:19">kot ma cwer matek molo lobo woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:19">in bene ityeko gen pa dano woko kitmeno.<verse eid="JOB 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 14:20" />In ibwoyogi woko matwal, ci gin cito gire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:20">imiyo wanggi loke, ka gito ci iryemogi woko.<verse eid="JOB 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 14:21" />Lutinogi ginongo deyo, ma gin pe dok gingeyo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:21">kidwokogi piny, ci gin pe giniang gin mo iye.<verse eid="JOB 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 14:22" />Gin gibedo kawinyo mere arem me komgi keken,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:22">gin gikoko cwercwiny ma meggi keken gi.”<verse eid="JOB 14:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOB 15" />
  <para style="s1">Erifaji dok ojuku Yubu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 15:1" />Erifaji Lateman ogamo dog Yubu kun waco ni,<verse eid="JOB 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 15:2" />“Itamoni dano ma laryeko twero gamo lok labongo ngec mo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:2">kun nongo peke ki ngec mo?<verse eid="JOB 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 15:3" />Itamoni en kelo lok pyem ma konye peke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:3">onyo lok ma pe kelo gin mo maber?<verse eid="JOB 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 15:4" />Ento in igengo dano ni pe gulwor Lubanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:4">igengogi ni pe gubed kalwodo lok inyime.<verse eid="JOB 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 15:5" />Pien lok ma a ki idogi aye nyutu ni in labal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:5">iloko lok pa jo ma bwolo dano ki ryeko.<verse eid="JOB 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 15:6" />Dogi keni aye miyo kop loyi, pe an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:6">lok dogi aye ma kelo lok ikomi.<verse eid="JOB 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 15:7" />In aye dano ma kikwongo nywalone ce?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:7">Meni onywali ma peya Lubanga oketo godi?<verse eid="JOB 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 15:8" />Yam kong onongo iwinyo yub ma i kacoke pa Lubanga?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:8">Dok itamo ni ryeko ducu obed meri keni?<verse eid="JOB 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 15:9" />Gin ango ma in ingeyo ma wan wakwiya?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:9">Iniang i gin ango ma wan pe waniang iyeni?<verse eid="JOB 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 15:10" />Dano ma otii ki dano ma wiye ki lwar gitye ikinwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:10">jo ma otii makato woru.<verse eid="JOB 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 15:11" />Itamoni lok ma Lubanga kweyo ki cwinyi lam mada ki boti?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:11">Kece nyo loke ma en loko kwedi moti obedo gin mo manok ki tung boti ba?<verse eid="JOB 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 15:12" />Pingo cwinyi nen oari woko?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:12">Pingo wangi nen ki kiniga?<verse eid="JOB 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 15:13" />Pingo iloko ki kinigani ikom Lubanga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:13">ma iweko lok macalo meno a ki i dogi?<verse eid="JOB 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 15:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 25:4-6">Yub 25:4-6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Dano kono gin ango, mamiyo en twero bedo labongo bal?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:14">Ngat ma dako aye onywalo kono gin ango,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:14">ma weko en bedo labongo bal mo?<verse eid="JOB 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 15:15" />Nen, Lubanga pe geno wa lumalaikane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:15">pe nenogi ni gileng;<verse eid="JOB 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 15:16" />ci dano kono, ma keni dok to woko bibedo ningning inyime,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:16">dano ma labalo ma oloko bal odoko macalo pii me amataneni?<verse eid="JOB 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 15:17" />Winy loka Yubu, wek atiti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:17">ci abinyuti gin ma dong aneno.<verse eid="JOB 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 15:18" />Jo ma luryeko gubedo katitone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:18">gin ma kwarigi bene yam guloko.<verse eid="JOB 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 15:19" />Lobogi yam kimiyo botgi pirgi ken gi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:19">ma larok mo pe ongakogi ki kaworo Lubangagi.<verse eid="JOB 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 15:20" />Dano marac bedo ki arem nino ducu me kwone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:20">peko tye pi ngat ma labwami pi mwaka ducu me kwone.<verse eid="JOB 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 15:21" />En bedo kawinyo dwon ma kele lworo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:21">ikare me kuc layak bibino ikome.<verse eid="JOB 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 15:22" />En peke ki gen me loyo ki i to,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:22">pien dong kiyubu ni kibityekogi woko ki pala lucwan.<verse eid="JOB 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 15:23" />En bedo kamal ata kayenyo kwon, kun waco ni, ‘Tye kwene?’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:23">En ngeyo atir ni inyime tye iye to.<verse eid="JOB 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 15:24" />Peko ki can keken aye bedo karyango kome;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:24">ci bwoye woko macalo rwot ma oyube pi mony.<verse eid="JOB 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 15:25" />Pien dano meno oryeyo cinge ikom Lubanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:25">obute kene ni etwero lweny ki Won Twer Ducu.<verse eid="JOB 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 15:26" />En ringo ki dingone ikom Lubanga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:26">ki kwot molane ma kinong.<verse eid="JOB 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 15:27" />Wange nen ma ocwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:27">ki pyere oyare malac.<verse eid="JOB 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 15:28" />En bibedo i taun madito mayam gudong nononi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:28">i odi ma dano pe myero gubed iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:28">i odi ma dong kicok mukugi woko.<verse eid="JOB 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 15:29" />Pimeno en pe bibedo lalonyo, lonyone pe birii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:29">lonyone pe binya mede ento birweny woko ki i lobo.<verse eid="JOB 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 15:30" />En pe bibwot ki i peko mabino ikome.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:30">En bibedo rom ki yat ma mac owango pote woko ma pud olot alota,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:30">ki yat ma yamo ooyo ture woko.<verse eid="JOB 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 15:31" />Kace en bwole kene kun keto gen ma mere ikom gin ma konye peke;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:31">kitmeno en bene binongo gin ma konye peke.<verse eid="JOB 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 15:32" />En birweny woko ma peya otii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:32">macalo jang yat ma ner ma pe dong lot.<verse eid="JOB 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 15:33" />En bibedo rom ki olok ma nyige oo ma peya ocek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:33">nyo yat jeituni ma ture oo woko.<verse eid="JOB 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 15:34" />Jo ma pe lworo Lubanga gibibedo lulur;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:34">ki mac bene biwango kema pa lucamcana woko.<verse eid="JOB 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 15:35" />Giyubu yub me timo tim aranyi ma adwogine aye tim maracu keken.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:35">Dok gipiro lok goba keken ki i cwinygi.”<verse eid="JOB 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOB 16" />
  <para style="s1">Yubu okok pi gin ma Lubanga otimo ikome</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 16:1" />Yubu ogamo ni,<verse eid="JOB 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 16:2" />“Atyeko winyo lok mapol marom ki meno;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:2">wun ducu wun lukwecwiny ma kela ayela keken.<verse eid="JOB 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 16:3" />Lokwu ma wupwodoni mono agikine peke?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:3">Gin ango ma ongeto iwu, ma oweko wuloko kitmeno?<verse eid="JOB 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 16:4" />An bene onongo atwero lok macalo wun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:4">ka nene wun aye wutye kit ma an atye kwede kombedi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:4">an bene onongo atwero rado lok pi jukuwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:4">kun ayengo ki wiya bene botwu.<verse eid="JOB 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 16:5" />Onongo atwero jingo cwinywu ki loka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:5">ki kweyo aremwu ki mit doga.<verse eid="JOB 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 16:6" />Kadi ka aloko arem koma pe kwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:6">onyo ka aling alinga, itamoni arem koma twero dok cen?<verse eid="JOB 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 16:7" />Adada, Lubanga koni dong oolo koma woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:7">oneko jona woko ducu.<verse eid="JOB 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 16:8" />Lubanga dong otyeko maka woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:8">ma oweko odoko caden me nyutu bala;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:8">ajony ma koma odong cogo nono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:8">ma miyo caden ni an abalo.<verse eid="JOB 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 16:9" />Lubanga i akemone otima malit macalo labwor ma kido kom lee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:9">okayo lake liking ikoma ki kiniga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:9">lamonena gaya ki wange macalo ngat ma pako tonge me neko dano.<verse eid="JOB 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 16:10" />Dano gungamo doggi ikoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:10">gudongo lema me anywar,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:10">guruma woko liking.<verse eid="JOB 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 16:11" />Lubanga dong omiya i cing jo ma kitgi pe atir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:11">en obola i cing jo maracu.<verse eid="JOB 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 16:12" />Onongo abedo mot ma opye, ci en oturu koma woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:12">omaka ki nguta, ci onginya matinotino.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:12">Lubanga tiyo kweda macalo kapwonyo lwenye,<verse eid="JOB 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 16:13" />ma wegi atume guruma dyere.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:13">En otucu olanga pil, labongo kica,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:13">ooyo pig kedana i ngom.<verse eid="JOB 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 16:14" />Oketo can ikoma teretere macalo lamony</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:14">ma bedo karingo ikom ot pi mukune woko.<verse eid="JOB 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 16:15" />Akwoyo bongo cola me arukana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:15">abutu i apwa ma piny oloya woko.<verse eid="JOB 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 16:16" />Wanga dong obok ki koko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:16">del wanga ocido macol licuc,<verse eid="JOB 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 16:17" />kadi bed pe atimo gin mo me bwami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:17">dok kadi legana bal mo peke iye.<verse eid="JOB 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 16:18" />In lobo, pe ium bal ma kitimo ikoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:18">dok pe iwek kokona obed me nono.<verse eid="JOB 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 16:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 19:25">Yub 19:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kadi kombedi, i ada, cadena tye iwi polo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:19">ngat ma pido pira tye kunu.<verse eid="JOB 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 16:20" />Lurema gicaya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:20">ci pig wanga cwer kun akok kwede bot Lubanga.<verse eid="JOB 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 16:21" />Amito ni ngat mo opid loka inyim Lubanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:21">macalo dano ma pido lok kun cung pi lawote.<verse eid="JOB 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 16:22" />Pien mwakana dong tye kakato akata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:22">abicito kama pe dong aromo dwogo ki iye.<verse eid="JOB 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOB 17" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 17:1" />Cwinya dong tye katum, kwona dong mito gik woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:1">kono lyel aye dong tye kakura.<verse eid="JOB 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 17:2" />Adada atye kaneno kit ma lunywar guruma kwede dyere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:2">atye kaneno kit ma giyenyo kolo kwede ikoma.<verse eid="JOB 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 17:3" />Ai Lubanga winy kokona, pien an ageno in.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:3">Pe tye ngat mo matwero cung pira.<verse eid="JOB 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 17:4" />Macalo dong ikwero yabo tamgi wek guniang lok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:4">pimeno pe dong iwek guloya.<verse eid="JOB 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 17:5" />Ngat ma tero lok roro ikom lawote wek enong dul me limgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:5">piny biloyo lutinone.<verse eid="JOB 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 17:6" />Lubanga omiyo nyinga odoko labol pa lwak;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:6">adoko dano ma lwak gingulu laa ikome<verse eid="JOB 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 17:7" />Wanga dong ocido woko pi kumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:7">cinga ki tyena ojony woko likang.<verse eid="JOB 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 17:8" />Pimeno jo ma giwaco ni kitgi atir giuru dok gijwat,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:8">ci gin ducu cako lok ikoma ni pe alworo Lubanga.<verse eid="JOB 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 17:9" />Dong ngat ma kite atir pud mede ki kite macon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:9">ki ngat ma cwinye leng teke mede ameda.<verse eid="JOB 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 17:10" />Ento ka wun ducu wubino bota,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:10">ci pe abinongo dano mo maryek ikinwu.<verse eid="JOB 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 17:11" />Karena dong okato, yub mayam ayubu dong otur woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:11">gena ducu dong peke.<verse eid="JOB 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 17:12" />Ento luwota giwaco ni dyewor aye dyeceng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:12">kun giwaco ni, ‘Dero dong cok,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:12">ento an pud angeyo ni atye i colpiny.<verse eid="JOB 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 17:13" />Gena ducu aye odong lyel me bedo oda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:13">kama abibutu iye i piny macol.<verse eid="JOB 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 17:14" />Kama bur lyel dong alwongo ni wora,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:14">kwidi ma bicamo koma alwongo ni maa, nyo lamera.<verse eid="JOB 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 17:15" />Ci gen ma mera kono dok tye kwene ka?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:15">Anga ma dok bineno gin maber ma ageno?<verse eid="JOB 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 17:16" />Gen mono bicito kweda wa i lyel?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:16">Wan mono wabilor kwede kacel i apwa?”<verse eid="JOB 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOB 18" />
  <para style="s1">Bildad oloko pi can ma poto ikom jo maracu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 18:1" />Bildad ma Lacua ogamo ni,<verse eid="JOB 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 18:2" />“Ibibedo kalok pi kare marom mene in Yubu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:2">Kong itam iling mot ci wabilok kwedi.<verse eid="JOB 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 18:3" />Pingo inenowa macalo dyangi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:3">Pingo inenowa macalo jo maming?<verse eid="JOB 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 18:4" />In itye kaketo ret ikomi kekeni ki kinigani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:4">Itamoni lobo myero kiwek odong nono piri?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:4">Itamoni Lubanga myero okob got woko ki i kabedone piri?<verse eid="JOB 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 18:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 21:17">Yub 21:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Eyo, dero pa dano marac bicido woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:5">leb mace pe biryeny.<verse eid="JOB 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 18:6" />Mac ma menyo i kemane bidoko ribiribi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:6">tara ma kingabo ka wiye kibineko woko.<verse eid="JOB 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 18:7" />Wot ma en woto ki tek bijwik,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:7">lok ma en kikome oyubu aye birete piny.<verse eid="JOB 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 18:8" />En moko i obwo ki tyene kene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:8">nyo woto iwi bur ma kikwinyo pi mako lee.<verse eid="JOB 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 18:9" />Layuta mako opunye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:9">owic ma kiciko dwalo tyene.<verse eid="JOB 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 18:10" />Kiciko tol i ngom pire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:10">kiciko kinu i yoo pi make.<verse eid="JOB 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 18:11" />Jami maracu makelo lworo orume woko tungi ki tungi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:11">malubu kore kama en cito iye ducu.<verse eid="JOB 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 18:12" />Kec obwoyo tekone woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:12">Peko ocung kun kure me poto ikome.<verse eid="JOB 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 18:13" />Two bibalo del kome ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:13">two marac mada bingunu dul kome woko.<verse eid="JOB 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 18:14" />Kibiywaye woko ki i kemane mayam en geno,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:14">kitere bot rwot maloyo kit gin ducu ma dano lworo.<verse eid="JOB 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 18:15" />Kemane biwang woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:15">ikare ma kibionyo mac calfa ipacone.<verse eid="JOB 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 18:16" />En bibedo rom ki yat ma lwite otwo woko ki piny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:16">ki ma jange oner woko ki malo.<verse eid="JOB 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 18:17" />Dano pe dong bipo pire i lobone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:17">nyinge pe dong biwinye i wanga yoo.<verse eid="JOB 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 18:18" />Kibicwale woko ki kama dero tye iye, wek obed i colpiny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:18">kibiryeme woko ki iwi lobo.<verse eid="JOB 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 18:19" />En pe bibedo ki latin nyo likwayo ikin lutuggi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:19">ngat mo pe bidong makwo kama yam en bedo iye.<verse eid="JOB 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 18:20" />Jo ma tung kupotoceng tipu komgi bito woko lirut pi gin ma otime ikome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:20">atiba bipoto ikom jo matye tung kunyango bene.<verse eid="JOB 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 18:21" />Adada, gang pa lubalo bibedo kumeno,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:21">meno aye gin ma bitime ikom dano ma kwiya Lubanga.”<verse eid="JOB 18:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOB 19" />
  <para style="s1">Lagam pa Yubu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 19:1" />Yubu ogamo ni,<verse eid="JOB 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 19:2" />“Wubiyela nio wa awene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:2">kun wuturu cwinya ki lok mapol?<verse eid="JOB 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 19:3" />Man dong tyen me apare ma wuyeta;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:3">lewic pe makowu me bedo katera marac kuman?<verse eid="JOB 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 19:4" />Kadi bed ni dong angak woko ada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:4">ci balane makowu ningning?<verse eid="JOB 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 19:5" />Ka ada wun wunyate ikoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:5">kun wuwaco ni lewic ma kiketo ikoma onyutu ni an labal,<verse eid="JOB 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 19:6" />dong myero wunge ni Lubanga aye otima marac,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:6">dok en otweya woko ki obwone.<verse eid="JOB 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 19:7" />Nen, kadi akok ni, ‘Kineka woko do,’ ci pe kigamo doga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:7">adange matek, ento ngat mo peke ma ngolo kopa ma atir.<verse eid="JOB 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 19:8" />Lubanga ocego yoo woko bota, pe atwero kato,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:8">oketo colpiny woko inyima kama acito iye ducu.<verse eid="JOB 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 19:9" />Lubanga okwanyo deyo woko ki ikoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:9">en okwanyo lalukana woko ki iwiya.<verse eid="JOB 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 19:10" />Lubanga otwoma tungi ki tungi calo ot ci ao ni rubuku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:10">ki gena bene en oputu woko macalo oputu yat.<verse eid="JOB 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 19:11" />Kiniga omake matek ikoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:11">ci otera macalo lakwore.<verse eid="JOB 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 19:12" />Monye gubino ikoma kacel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:12">gutoro cel lobo guruma woko dyere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:12">ci gugony gurumu kemana.<verse eid="JOB 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 19:13" />En opoka woko ki bot omegina omiyo atye mabor kwedgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:13">jo ma ceng gin luwota ducu adoko welo ki tung botgi.<verse eid="JOB 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 19:14" />Wadina ki lurema gurwenyo woko;<verse eid="JOB 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 19:15" />wele mayam gibino kalima i oda dong wigi owil woko ikoma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:15">angecana gibedo kweda calo an a welo ki tung botgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:15">adoko larok ki i wanggi.<verse eid="JOB 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 19:16" />Ka alwongo latica, en pe gamo doga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:16">an myero abak doga abaka bote.<verse eid="JOB 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 19:17" />Aluu doga odoko rac wa bot dakona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:17">omegina ma lutino pa maa gidag ngwec koma.<verse eid="JOB 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 19:18" />Kadi wa lutino matino gicaya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:18">ka aa, gin loko lok marac ikoma.<verse eid="JOB 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 19:19" />Lurema ma gingeya ducu igi dong okwera woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:19">jo mayam amarogi dong guloke ikoma.<verse eid="JOB 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 19:20" />Cogona dong omake woko ki del koma ki ringo koma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:20">anen ki laka keken.<verse eid="JOB 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 19:21" />Kica omakwu ikoma ba, wun lurema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:21">pien cing Lubanga dong otyeko gudu koma.<verse eid="JOB 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 19:22" />Pingo wubedo kauna kitma Lubanga tye kauna kwedeni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:22">Can ma aneno, ki arem koma peya oromowu?<verse eid="JOB 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 19:23" />Loka ducu kono kicoyo woko cut!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:23">Kono ceng kicoyo i buk!<verse eid="JOB 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 19:24" />Kono ceng kigoro loka ki kalam nyonyo ikom pata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:24">ci kimwono ki gin macol, wek orii matwal.<verse eid="JOB 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 19:25" />Pien angeyo ni Lacungudwara tye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:25">ci lacen en bicung pira iwi lobo;<verse eid="JOB 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 19:26" />kadi ka dong del koma obale woko kuman,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:26">ci abineno Lubanga nongo pud atye ki komani.<verse eid="JOB 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 19:27" />An kikoma abinene kun cung pira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:27">abinene ki wanga, pe bibedo welo ki tung bota.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JOB 19:27" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:27">Cwinya opoto ni ling, pien wuwaco ni,<verse eid="JOB 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 19:28" />‘Wabiune ningning?’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:28">Onyo ni, ‘Pagi me peko man oa ki bote.’<verse eid="JOB 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 19:29" />Ento omyero wulwor pala lucwan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:29">pien kiniga aye kelo can me to,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:29">wek wunge ni ngolo kop tye.”<verse eid="JOB 19:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOB 20" />
  <para style="s1">Lagam pa Jopar</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 20:1" />Jopar Lanaamat ogamo ni,<verse eid="JOB 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 20:2" />“Pi lok ma iloko oweko tama odiya me dok iloki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:2">pi rucurucu ma atye kwede i cwinya.<verse eid="JOB 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 20:3" />Gin ma iwaco tye calo yet bota,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:3">ento angeyo kit ma omyero adoki kwede iye.<verse eid="JOB 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 20:4" />In pe ingeyo lok man nia wa con,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:4">nicake ikare ma kiketo dano iwi lobo,<verse eid="JOB 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 20:5" />ni kijira pa dano marac winye pi kare manok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:5">yomcwiny pa dano ma pe lworo Lubanga rii pi kare manok mo keken?<verse eid="JOB 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 20:6" />Kadi ka odongo mabor ma o wa i polo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:6">kadi ka wiye gudu pol,<verse eid="JOB 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 20:7" />ci en birwenyo woko matwal macalo cete;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:7">jo mayam gunene gibiwaco ni, ‘En tye kwene ka?’<verse eid="JOB 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 20:8" />En bilal woko macalo lek;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:8">kibiryeme woko macalo ginanyuta me dyewor.<verse eid="JOB 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 20:9" />Jo mayam gunene pe dok gibinene aye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:9">kadi kabedone pe dok binen matwal.<verse eid="JOB 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 20:10" />Lutinone gibiyenyo cwak ki bot lucan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:10">gibidwoko lonyo mayam lunyodogi gukwaloni woko cen.<verse eid="JOB 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 20:11" />Cogo kome mayam opong ki teko me awobineni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:11">kibiyike kwede i apwa.<verse eid="JOB 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 20:12" />Kadi ka timo tim maracu obedo calo gin ma lim idoge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:12">kadi bed en kano i te lebe,<verse eid="JOB 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 20:13" />kadi en pe ye ngulune,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:13">kun kano pud mede ki bedo kwede idoge,<verse eid="JOB 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 20:14" />ento loke ki i cin iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:14">doko kec macalo kwir twol.<verse eid="JOB 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 20:15" />Ngat marac mwonyo lim ma en onongo i yo maraci ci ngoko woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:15">Lubanga cwalo kato woko ki i iye.<verse eid="JOB 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 20:16" />En bidoto kwir twol gola,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:16">lak twol ororo bineke woko.<verse eid="JOB 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 20:17" />En pe bineno kulu moo jeituni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:17">nyo laora mamol kic ki cak.<verse eid="JOB 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 20:18" />En bidwoko gin ma en onongo ki tice matek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:18">en pe bicamo magoba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:18">ma en olimo pi cato wile,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:18">pe bilimo iye yomcwiny mo.<verse eid="JOB 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 20:19" />Pien yam odiyo lucan ci otenyogi woko ata</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:19">omayo odi ma ceng en pe ogerogi.<verse eid="JOB 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 20:20" />En ngat ma owor ma mitine pe bicobe wa ki acel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:20">pien gin mo marome peke.<verse eid="JOB 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 20:21" />Yomcwinye ki berbedone pe birii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:21">pien ceng ikare ma en camo ca, pe oweko gin mo odong.<verse eid="JOB 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 20:22" />Ikare ma jamine dong onya mapol, can bipoto ikome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:22">cwercwiny ki tekone ducu bipoto ikome.<verse eid="JOB 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 20:23" />Lubanga bicwalo kinigane malyet ikome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:23">miyo cwer ikome macalo kot ma ka came,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:23">wek oyeng kwede liking.<verse eid="JOB 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 20:24" />Ka en biringo jami lweny me nyonyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:24">ci atero mola bicele woko pil.<verse eid="JOB 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 20:25" />Kibiputu ki i tung ngeye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:25">lebe maryenyi bikato woko ki pig kedane;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:25">kome binyonge woko ki lworo.<verse eid="JOB 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 20:26" />Lim ma en okanoni, bibale woko ducu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:26">mac ma pe dano aye ocwinyo bityeke woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:26">biwango wa jami ducu ma odong i ode.<verse eid="JOB 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 20:27" />Polo binyutu bale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:27">lobo bikelo lok me caden ikome.<verse eid="JOB 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 20:28" />Lonyone kibiyakone woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:28">dano bitero jamine inino me kiniga pa Lubanga.<verse eid="JOB 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 20:29" />Man en aye pok pa dano marac ma a ki bot Lubanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:29">man ginaleya ma Lubanga ociko pire.”<verse eid="JOB 20:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOB 21" />
  <para style="s1">Lagam ma Yubu dok ogamo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 21:1" />Yubu dok ogamo ni,<verse eid="JOB 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 21:2" />“Wuwiny loka maber,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:2">ci meno aye bibedo kit kweyo cwiny ma amito ki botwu.<verse eid="JOB 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 21:3" />Wudii cwinywu, ci abilok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:3">lacen ka dong aloko otum, ci wumede giwu ki nywara.<verse eid="JOB 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 21:4" />Atye kakoko ikom dano bo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:4">Myero adi cwinya pingo?<verse eid="JOB 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 21:5" />Ka wunena wunu, ci pe romo weko dogwu two woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:5">ma weko wubedo ki ur?<verse eid="JOB 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 21:6" />Ka atamo pi gin ma otime ikoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:6">cwinya poto, ma koma myel amyela.<verse eid="JOB 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 21:7" />Pingo jo maracu gimede ki kwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:7">gito ma kun nongo gutii matek i lobo, dok lonyogi mede amede?<verse eid="JOB 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 21:8" />Lutinogi doko dito ma lunyodogi pud kwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:8">likwayogi dongo kun gineno bene ki wanggi.<verse eid="JOB 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 21:9" />Odigi tye ki kuc labongo lworo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:9">odoo pa Lubanga pe o ikomgi.<verse eid="JOB 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 21:10" />Twoni dyangigi ito ma pe giloc,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:10">megi dyangigi pe bwogo lutino abwoga.<verse eid="JOB 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 21:11" />Lutinogi mol calo lwak romi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:11">ka gicito katuku.<verse eid="JOB 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 21:12" />Giwero ki ajaa ki opuk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:12">ginyutu yomcwinygi ki dwon nyamulere.<verse eid="JOB 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 21:13" />Gityeko karegi ki berbedo keken,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:13">gito mot ki kuc.<verse eid="JOB 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 21:14" />Giwaco ki Lubanga ni, ‘A woko ki botwa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:14">Pe wamito ngeyo yoni.<verse eid="JOB 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 21:15" />Won Twer Ducu mono en anga ma myero watii bote?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:15">Ka walego en wabinongo kony ango?’<verse eid="JOB 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 21:16" />Nen ba, gin gitamo ni, lonyo ma meggi ginongo pirgi ken gi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:16">Ento an pe atwero ye tam pa jo maracu.<verse eid="JOB 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 21:17" />In dong ineno ka jo maracu gito atura tyen adi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:17">In dong ineno tyen adi ka can poto ikomgi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:17">Lubanga mono dong opoko arem botgi pi kinigane tyen adi?<verse eid="JOB 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 21:18" />Ineno mono ni gibedo macalo cuci ma yamo kolo tero woko ata?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:18">Nyo macalo cuci kal ma yamo kot kolo?<verse eid="JOB 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 21:19" />Wuwaco ni, ‘Lubanga kano can me balgi pi lutinogi.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:19">Wek ocul botgi gin kikomgi ci guniang.<verse eid="JOB 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 21:20" />Wek gunen ki wanggi ka can poto ikomgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:20">ci gubil kiniga pa Won Twer Ducu.<verse eid="JOB 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 21:21" />Gin kono giparo ango pi likwayogi inge togi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:21">ma dong kityeko ngolo wel dwegi me kwogi woko?<verse eid="JOB 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 21:22" />Ngat mo twero pwonyo Lubanga ki ryeko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:22">en ngat ma ngolo kop kadi wa pa jo ma gitye malo i polo?<verse eid="JOB 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 21:23" />Jo mukene to ma pud komgi tek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:23">matye maber ki kuc madwong;<verse eid="JOB 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 21:24" />ma komgi ocwer,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:24">wa cogo komgi bene opong ki teko.<verse eid="JOB 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 21:25" />Ngat mukene to ki cwercwiny madwong,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:25">ma nongo yam peya obilo gin maber.<verse eid="JOB 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 21:26" />Ento gin ducu gito gicito ilyel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:26">kwidi pong ikomgi ducu.<verse eid="JOB 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 21:27" />Nen, angeyo tamwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:27">ki yubwu me timo gin marac ikoma.<verse eid="JOB 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 21:28" />Pien wuwaco ni, ‘Odi pa luker ki pa lulonyo gitye kwene?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:28">Kema mayam jo maracu bedo iyeni tye kwene?<verse eid="JOB 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 21:29" />Wun pe wubedo kapenyo jo ma giwoto i yoo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:29">Pe wuye ongon ma gubolo botwu,<verse eid="JOB 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 21:30" />ma nyutu ni dano marac kiweke woko inino me can,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:30">dok bene kilare woko ikare me kiniga?<verse eid="JOB 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 21:31" />Anga matwero nyute kite kamaleng?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:31">Dok anga matwero cule pi time maracuni?<verse eid="JOB 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 21:32" />Ka kitero kome i bur,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:32">dano kuru lyele.<verse eid="JOB 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 21:33" />Ngom mapwot aye kionyo kiumu ki kome;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:33">jo ducu gilubu kore,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:33">lwak jo ma gitelo nyime pe kwane.<verse eid="JOB 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 21:34" />Ci wun dok wubikweyo cwinya ningning ki lok ma tere peke ni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:34">Gin mo peke ma odong ikom lagamwu, kono goba keken.”<verse eid="JOB 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOB 22" />
  <para style="s1">Lok ma Erifaji ogamo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 22:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 35:6-8">Yub 35:6-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Erifaji Lateman dok ogamo ni,<verse eid="JOB 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 22:2" />“Itamoni dano twero bedo ki kony bot Lubanga?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:2">Tika ngat matye ki ryeko twero bedo ki kony mo bote?<verse eid="JOB 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 22:3" />Itamoni Won Twer Ducu cwinye bedo yom ka kiti atir?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:3">Lubanga mono twero nongo kony mo ki boti ka bal mo peke ikomi?<verse eid="JOB 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 22:4" />Nyo itamo ni pien ilwore ma omiyo en juki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:4">ci miyo en ngolo kop ikomi?<verse eid="JOB 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 22:5" />Pe tim marac ma itimo aye pol?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:5">Bali agikine peke.<verse eid="JOB 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 22:6" />Pien imiyo omegini gijengo jamigi nonono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:6">ci ilunyu bongo woko ki ikom dano iweko gudong munero.<verse eid="JOB 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 22:7" />In ceng pe imiyo pii amata bot ngat ma ool,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:7">itwono kwon bot ngat ma kec kwon neko.<verse eid="JOB 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 22:8" />In ibedo ka tamoni in aye oteka me bedo won lobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:8">dok pien dano giwori, omiyo dong icako bedo iye.<verse eid="JOB 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 22:9" />In ceng iryemo mon to woko ki cinggi nono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:9">kun bene itero lutino kic marac.<verse eid="JOB 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 22:10" />Pimeno kirumi woko ki owic,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:10">lworo onyongo komi woko oyotoyot.<verse eid="JOB 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 22:11" />Dero ceng odoko macol, ma oweko pe itwero neno piny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:11">ki lalele omwonyi woko.<verse eid="JOB 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 22:12" />Itamoni Lubanga mono pe tye wa malo i polo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:12">Nen lakalatwe ma gitye malo kit ma gibor kwede!<verse eid="JOB 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 22:13" />Pimeno iwaco ni, ‘Lubanga ngeyo gin ango?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:13">Wange romo tucu pol mapek pi ngolo kop?<verse eid="JOB 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 22:14" />Pol ma ocido oboyo kome woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:14">pimeno en pe twero neno bal.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:14">En woto mere wa i dan polo.’<verse eid="JOB 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 22:15" />Pud imoko i yo macon</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:15">ma jo maracu yam gubedo kalubune?<verse eid="JOB 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 22:16" />Ceng kiceyogi woko ma peya karegi oromo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:16">gutine lalele omolo woko.<verse eid="JOB 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 22:17" />Ceng guwaco bot Lubanga ni, ‘A woko ki botwa,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:17">dok ni, ‘Gin ango ma Won Twer Ducu twero timo ikomwa?’<verse eid="JOB 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 22:18" />Kun en aye mayam opongo odigi ki jami mabeco.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:18">An adag tam pa jo maracu!<verse eid="JOB 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 22:19" />Jo ma kitgi atir gineno ki yomcwiny ka kipwodo jo maracu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:19">jo ma pe ki bal ginyero anyera,<verse eid="JOB 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 22:20" />kun giwaco ni, ‘Lukworwa dong kityekogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:20">jamigi ma odong mac dong owango woko.’<verse eid="JOB 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 22:21" />Roc wat ikin in ki Lubanga, ci ibibedo ki kuc;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:21">en aye bimiyo gin maber bino boti.<verse eid="JOB 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 22:22" />Jol pwony ma a ki idoge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:22">ci iket loke i cwinyi.<verse eid="JOB 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 22:23" />Dwog bot Won Twer Ducu, ci ibed mwol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:23">bol tim ma pe atir woko ducu ma kitimo i paconi.<verse eid="JOB 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 22:24" />Ka itero jabuni calo apwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:24">dok ka itero jabuni me Opir macalo gweng me laora kulu,<verse eid="JOB 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 22:25" />ci ka i iweko Won Twer Ducu aye obedo jabuni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:25">ki ryal ma pire tek boti,<verse eid="JOB 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 22:26" />ka itimo kitmeno ci cwinyi bibedo yom pi Won Twer Ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:26">ci ibicito inyime labongo lewic mo.<verse eid="JOB 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 22:27" />Ibilego en, ci en biwinyo legani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:27">ci ibicobo kwongi bote.<verse eid="JOB 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 22:28" />Gin ducu ma itamo bicobe maber,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:28">ci nyimi bibedo leng.<verse eid="JOB 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 22:29" />Pien Lubanga dwoko luwake piny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:29">ento en laro jo mamwol.<verse eid="JOB 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 22:30" />En laro dano ma pe tiyo gin marac,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:30">Lubanga bilare pi tiyo gin maber.”<verse eid="JOB 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOB 23" />
  <para style="s1">Lok ma Yubu dok ogamo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 23:1" />Yubu ogamo kun waco ni:<verse eid="JOB 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 23:2" />“Tin bene aloko ma iya kec;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:2">kadi bed atye kacur, ento cinge mede ki nura.<verse eid="JOB 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 23:3" />Kono ceng angeyo kama atwero nonge iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:3">kono ao wa i kabedone!<verse eid="JOB 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 23:4" />Kono ayeko loka inyime wek ongol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:4">onongo acano lok koma kore ki kore.<verse eid="JOB 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 23:5" />Kono onongo angeyo gin ma en bigama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:5">kono aniang gin ma en biwaco bota.<verse eid="JOB 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 23:6" />Onongo en mono bipyem kweda ki twerone maditi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:6">Pe kumeno; kono en oketo cwinye kawinyo an.<verse eid="JOB 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 23:7" />Dano ma kite atir twero pyem kwede ki kunu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:7">ci onongo en bitucu ni bal mo peke ikoma.<verse eid="JOB 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 23:8" />Nen ayenye, acito anyim, ento en pe tye kunu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:8">adok cen, ento pe anonge.<verse eid="JOB 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 23:9" />Ayenye tung kumalo, ento pe amedo ki nene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:9">ayenye tung kupiny, pe anene bene.<verse eid="JOB 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 23:10" />Ento Lubanga ngeyo yo ducu ma acito iye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:10">ka en otema, ci abikati macalo jabu maleng.<verse eid="JOB 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 23:11" />Abedo kalubu kore kikome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:11">pe angak kamukene.<verse eid="JOB 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 23:12" />Pe adok cen aweko lubu cik ma en ociko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:12">lok ma en owaco akano i cwinya macalo lonyona.<verse eid="JOB 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 23:13" />Ento en pe loke, anga matwero pyem kwede?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:13">En tiyo gire gin ma iye mito.<verse eid="JOB 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 23:14" />Pimeno en bicobo gin ma en oyubu pira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:14">ki lwak lok macalo meno ma en tye kwede i cwinye.<verse eid="JOB 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 23:15" />Pieno koma onyo koyo inyime;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:15">ka atamo pi jami magi ducu miyo abedo ki lworo.<verse eid="JOB 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 23:16" />Lubanga otyeko kelo lworo woko icwinya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:16">Won Twer Ducu otyeko miyo koma onyo koyo.<verse eid="JOB 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 23:17" />Lubanga ouma woko ki colpiny</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:17">ento an adag ling aling.<verse eid="JOB 23:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOB 24" />
  <para style="s1">Yubu omede ki lagam ma mere</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 24:1" />Pingo Won Twer Ducu pe oketo kare me ngolo kop?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:1">Pingo jo ma gingeyo en pe gineno ninone?<verse eid="JOB 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 24:2" />Dano gidiro kidi me wangco lobo pi medo ngomgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:2">gimayo lee pa jo mukene, ci gikwayogi calo meggi.<verse eid="JOB 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 24:3" />Gikwanyo kana pa lutino kic,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:3">ki gikwanyo twon pa dato nio ka otyeko culu banya.<verse eid="JOB 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 24:4" />Gicoro lucan gidirogi cen ki i yoo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:4">ci lucan ma i lobo giringo gikane woko liweng.<verse eid="JOB 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 24:5" />Pimeno, lucan giwoto macalo kana me tim ka gicito kacane ki tic matek;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:5">giyenyo camgi ki i tim ata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:5">wek obed kwon pa lutinogi.<verse eid="JOB 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 24:6" />Gigwero obot cam ma i poto ma pe meggi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:6">gibeko nyig olok ki i poti pa jo maracu.<verse eid="JOB 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 24:7" />I dyewor gibutu nono labongo gium,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:7">gin mo peke me gwokogi ki i ngico piny.<verse eid="JOB 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 24:8" />Kot ma a ki iwi got pwodogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:8">gipade ikom pata got pien kagwokegi peke.<verse eid="JOB 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 24:9" />Jo maracu gimayo lutino kic ki i kor mon, wek gubed opiigi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:9">gitero lutino pi den.<verse eid="JOB 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 24:10" />Ento lucan giwire nono, labongo ginaruka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:10">giyeyo ngano ma kikayo, kun gitye ki kec.<verse eid="JOB 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 24:11" />Gibiyo moo jeituni i poti pa jo maracu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:11">gibiyo nyig olok bwino ki laa doggi nono.<verse eid="JOB 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 24:12" />Lucan ma gito ki i taun madito gikok matek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:12">ki jo ma olimo ret gikok ki cwinygi ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:12">ento Lubanga pe paro pi legagi.<verse eid="JOB 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 24:13" />Tye jo mogo ma igi dag dero;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:13">pe gungiyo tic kwede,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:13">pe gimaro lubu yone.<verse eid="JOB 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 24:14" />Lanek a kwarpiny</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:14">me neko lacan ki dano ma piny oloyo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:14">ki i dyewor en doko lakwo.<verse eid="JOB 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 24:15" />Lakwele bene kuru piny ma ribiribi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:15">kun waco ni, ‘Ngat mo pe ma nena’; ci kano wange woko.<verse eid="JOB 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 24:16" />Ka piny col gituru odi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:16">ka dyeceng ci gicego wigi i ot; pe gimaro dero piny.<verse eid="JOB 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 24:17" />Pien ka piny col, meno aye rupiny ki tung botgi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:17">piny macol ma dano lworoni en aye laremgi.”<verse eid="JOB 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="sp">[Jopar]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jo mukene tamo ni Jopar aye oloko lok man. </char></note></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 24:18" />“Ento jo maracu aye pii ma opong mologi woko oyotoyot;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:18">ki lobo ma meggi bene Lubanga oceno woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:18">dok pe lapakaca mo yenyo tic i poto olokgi.<verse eid="JOB 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 24:19" />Kit macalo pee mee woko pi lyeto me ceng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:19">kitmeno bene lubalo girweny matwal i lyel.<verse eid="JOB 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 24:20" />Wa megigi wigi biwil ikomgi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:20">wa kwidi bene binongo ni gimit,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:20">ngat mo ma bipo pirgi dong peke;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:20">kumeno lutim maracu gibitur calo yat.<verse eid="JOB 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 24:21" />Giunu mon ma lulur ma lutinogi peke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:21">pe bene gikonyo mon to.<verse eid="JOB 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 24:22" />Ento Lubanga aye ki tekone tyeko jo matego;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:22">kadi bed gua malo, ci en pud dwokogi piny.<verse eid="JOB 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 24:23" />En weko gicung kun gitamo ni gitye maber,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:23">ento en bedo kangiyo gin ducu ma gitimo.<verse eid="JOB 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 24:24" />Giile malo pi kare manok, lacen girwenyo woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:24">macalo doo ma ner ci two woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:24">nyo macalo wit ngano ma kimworo woko.<verse eid="JOB 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 24:25" />Ka pe kumeno, anga matwero nyutu ni an lagoba?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:25">Anga ma waco ni lok ma awaconi pe kakare?”<verse eid="JOB 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JOB 25" />
  <para style="s1">Lagam pa Bildad mukene</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 25:1" />Bildad Lacua ogamo ni,<verse eid="JOB 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 25:2" />“Loc tye bot Lubanga, myero dano gulwore;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 25:2">en miyo kuce nya malo i polo.<verse eid="JOB 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 25:3" />Mony pa Lubanga twero kwane?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 25:3">Jo mene ma cenge pe menyogi?<verse eid="JOB 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 25:4" />Dano twero bedo ma kite atir ningning inyim Lubanga?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 25:4">Ngat ma dako onywalo twero bedo leng ningning?<verse eid="JOB 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 25:5" />Nen, ki iwang Lubanga dwe bene pe ryeny, lakalatwe bene pe gileng.<verse eid="JOB 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 25:6" />Ci dano kono twero bedo leng ningning inyim Lubanga ma en kwidi ma mamwani?”<verse eid="JOB 25:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JOB 26" />
  <para style="s1">Lagam pa Yubu bot Bildad</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 26:1" />Yubu dok ogamo ni,<verse eid="JOB 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 26:2" />“Kit ma ikonya kwede dit adada!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:2">An dano ma agoro dok apeke ki tek mo!<verse eid="JOB 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 26:3" />Kit ma ikonyo kwede ngat ma pe ki ryeko ki tam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:3">kun itito bote lok me ngec maber mapol!<verse eid="JOB 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 26:4" />Anga ma okonyi oweko iwaco lok meno?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:4">Cwiny ma itye kalok kwedeni ilimo ki bot anga?”<verse eid="JOB 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Bildad<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lok man kitamo ni Bildad aye oloko kadi bed nyinge peke iye. </char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 26:5" />“Tipu pa jo ma oto ma gitye piny komgi myel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:5">ki i pii matye ite lobo.<verse eid="JOB 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 26:6" />Lyel tye munero ki inyim Lubanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:6">lobo pa jo ma oto peke bene ki giumu wiye.<verse eid="JOB 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 26:7" />Lubanga oyaro but polo tung kumalo kama tye nono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:7">pe ocibo lobo ikom gin mo.<verse eid="JOB 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 26:8" />Lubanga pongo pol ki pii malo i polo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:8">ci pol pe tyer poke woko pi pek pa pii.<verse eid="JOB 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 26:9" />En umu wang dwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:9">kun yaro pole umu woko.<verse eid="JOB 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 26:10" />En olungu lawala iwi pii me poko wangco,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:10">me poko dero ki mutu.<verse eid="JOB 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 26:11" />Ka ocoko wir ma gutingo polo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:11">ci giyenge dok gibedo ki lworo.<verse eid="JOB 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 26:12" />Nam oling pi twerone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:12">ogoyo min kulu Rakab pi ryekone.<verse eid="JOB 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 26:13" />Yamone omiyo polo oware onen maleng;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:13">en aye ocobo twol matye kamol ringo woko.<verse eid="JOB 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 26:14" />Nen, man pud doge, pe kom tice kikome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:14">wawinyo macalo lok ma kikwilo akwila ma winyone tek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:14">ento anga ma niang ikom twerone ka mor calo mor kot.”<verse eid="JOB 26:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JOB 27" />
  <para style="s1">Yubu pud moko ni kite atir</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 27:1" />Yubu dok omede ki loke kun waco ni,<verse eid="JOB 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 27:2" />“Akwongo ki nying Lubanga makwo ma okwanyo twerona woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:2">en Lubanga Won Twer Ducu ma omiyo cwinya odoko kec ni,<verse eid="JOB 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 27:3" />pi kare ducu ma pud atye ki kwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:3">ma yweyo pa Lubanga pud tye i uma,<verse eid="JOB 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 27:4" />doga pe biloko goba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:4">ki leba bene pe biloko lok me bwolo dano.<verse eid="JOB 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 27:5" />Pe abiye lokwu matwal ni gin ma wuloko tye kakare;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:5">nio wang ma ato, ento pud abiwaco ni cwinya leng.<verse eid="JOB 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 27:6" />Pud abicung matek kun awaco ni kita tye atir, pe abiloke;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:6">angeyo ki i cwinya kena ni pe tye nino mo i kwona ducu ma lewic myero omaka iye.<verse eid="JOB 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 27:7" />Wek lukwora gunen can macalo jo maracu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:7">Wek jo ma gimito lweny kweda kitimgi macalo lubalo!<verse eid="JOB 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 27:8" />Dano ma pe lworo Lubanga tye ki gen ango ka kwone otum woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:8">ka Lubanga dong okwanyo kwone woko?<verse eid="JOB 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 27:9" />Itamoni Lubanga biwinyo kokone ka ayela mo obino ikome?<verse eid="JOB 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 27:10" />Itamoni cwinye bibedo yom ikom Won Twer Ducu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:10">Dok itamoni bilego Lubanga kare ducu?<verse eid="JOB 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 27:11" />Wek kong apwonywu ki lok ma dok ikom twer pa Lubanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:11">pe aumu kit tam ma Won Twer Ducu tye kwede.<verse eid="JOB 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 27:12" />Ka wun ducu dong wutyeko neno pirwu kenwu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:12">ci pingo dok wuloko lok ma konye peke?”<verse eid="JOB 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lagam pa Jopar</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 27:13" />Jopar ogamo ni, “Man can ma Lubanga poko bot dano marac,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:13">man gin ma jo ma giunu jo mukene ginongo ki bot Won Twer Ducu.<verse eid="JOB 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 27:14" />Ka lutino pa dano marac gunya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:14">kinekogi woko ki pala lucwan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:14">lutino ma en onywalo pe gibedo ki cam ma romogi.<verse eid="JOB 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 27:15" />Lutinone ma pud gikwo two gemo aye nekogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:15">ci mon gi pe bikokogi.<verse eid="JOB 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 27:16" />Kadi bed odur lim ma odure calo kweyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:16">ki ocoko bongi obako lipim,<verse eid="JOB 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 27:17" />en twero cokone mere, ento dano ma kite atir aye ma birukugi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:17">dano ma peke ki bal aye ma bipoko lime.<verse eid="JOB 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 27:18" />Ot ma en ogero bibedo calo obwo oboropyen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:18">nyo ot aduc ma kiyubu pi kuru cam matye i poto.<verse eid="JOB 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 27:19" />Ceng mo en bibutu piny ma nongo pud olony,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:19">ento ka oyabo wange odiko ci nongo gin mo dong peke.<verse eid="JOB 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 27:20" />Gin makelo lworo bimwonye woko macalo pii lalele;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:20">yamo lapiru bitinge woko i cwiny dyewor.<verse eid="JOB 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 27:21" />Yamo ma a kunyango bitinge woko tere matwal;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:21">kun kwanye woko ki i kabedone.<verse eid="JOB 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 27:22" />Yamo bicore ikome labongo kica,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:22">ma nongo en ringo ki teke ducu wek ebwot woko ki iye.<verse eid="JOB 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 27:23" />Yamo bikodo cur mager ikore,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:23">ma ngur calo lapiru.”<verse eid="JOB 27:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JOB 28" />
  <para style="s1">Pak pi ryeko</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 28:1" />“Bur tye kama kikwinyo iye ryal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:1">ki kabedo kama kiliyo iye jabu bene tye.<verse eid="JOB 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 28:2" />Nyonyo kikwinyo ki i ngom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:2">mola kinongo ki i gweng ka kilenyo.<verse eid="JOB 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 28:3" />Dano gimenyo mac tara ite ngom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:3">kun giyenyo gweng nyonyo nio wa i agikine</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:3">i mutu ki piny macol licuc.<verse eid="JOB 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 28:4" />Gikwinyo bur i nota kama dano pe bedo iye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:4">ki kama luwot i yoo bene pe gio iye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:4">Kilutugi ki tol ci gilyere iye kama dano mukene peke iye.<verse eid="JOB 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 28:5" />Ki malo iwi lobo cam cek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:5">ento ki piny ite lobo acelu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:5">mac buke iye ci muku gwenge ngenyo woko.<verse eid="JOB 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 28:6" />Ikin gwenge tye iye godi matino ma bulu me wel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:6">matye iye luru jabu.<verse eid="JOB 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 28:7" />Yoo ma cito kunu acut mo pe ma ngeyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:7">ocecu bene peya oneno.<verse eid="JOB 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 28:8" />Lee tim ma lunyata peya gunyono kunu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:8">labwor bene peya owok ki iye.<verse eid="JOB 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 28:9" />Dano keto cinge itic ikom pata matek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:9">ci muku wa got madit ki itere piny.<verse eid="JOB 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 28:10" />En baro yoo pii ikin gweng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:10">ci nongo gin me wel.<verse eid="JOB 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 28:11" />Gigolo wa kama pii kati ki iye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:11">ci gikelo kamaleng gin ma okane.<verse eid="JOB 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 28:12" />Ento ryeko kibinongo ki kwene?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:12">Niang matut kabedone tye kwene?<verse eid="JOB 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 28:13" />Dano pe ngeyo yoo ma cito iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:13">ryeko bene pe nonge i lobo pa jo makwo.<verse eid="JOB 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 28:14" />Kut me nam madito giwaco ni, ‘Pe tye i iwa,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:14">nam matino bene giwaco ni, ‘Peke botwa.’<verse eid="JOB 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 28:15" />Jabu ki ryal pe twero wilone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:15">pe tye wel lim mo ma kiromo culu pire.<verse eid="JOB 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 28:16" />Pe kitwero poro wele ki jabu me Opir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:16">onyo kidi me wel macalo onik nyo capir.<verse eid="JOB 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 28:17" />Jabu ki madara pe rom kwede,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:17">pe kibilokone kadi wa ki atego me jabu maber.<verse eid="JOB 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 28:18" />Pe kibiporo ki tiko me wel ma kware nyo ma tare;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:18">wel ryeko tye lamal kato wel jami mukene me wel woko ducu.<verse eid="JOB 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 28:19" />Kidi ma obedo atworo me Etiopia pe kitwero porone kwede,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:19">wa jabu ma kiliyo maber bene pe romo wilone.<verse eid="JOB 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 28:20" />Ci dong ryeko kono a ki kwene?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:20">Niang matut bedo kwene?<verse eid="JOB 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 28:21" />Okane woko ki iwang gin makwo ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:21">oume woko ki bot winyo me polo.<verse eid="JOB 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 28:22" />Lyel ki to giwaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:22">‘Lok ikom ryeko wan wawinyo awinya keken.’<verse eid="JOB 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 28:23" />Lubanga kene aye ngeyo yone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:23">en ngeyo kama ryeko nonge iye.<verse eid="JOB 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 28:24" />Pien Lubanga neno wa i agiki me lobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:24">neno wa jami ducu matye ite polo.<verse eid="JOB 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 28:25" />Ikare ma en omoko kit ma teko pa yamo myero obed kwede,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:25">kun omoko bene kama pii me nam myero ogik iye;<verse eid="JOB 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 28:26" />ikare ma en omoko kwene kama kot myero ocwer iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:26">dok ocimo yoo ma lutkot myero olubi;<verse eid="JOB 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 28:27" />ikare meno Lubanga oneno ryeko, ongiyo maber,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:27">omiyo ocung ci otato tere.<verse eid="JOB 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 28:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 111:10">Jab 111:10</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 1:7">Car 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 9:10">9:10</ref></char>
    </note>Ci owaco bot dano ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:28">‘Nen, lworo Rwot en aye ryeko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:28">bwoto timo gin marac aye kelo niang matut.’”<verse eid="JOB 28:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JOB 29" />
  <para style="s1">Lok ma Yubu dok ogamo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 29:1" />Yubu dok omede ki loke kun waco ni,<verse eid="JOB 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 29:2" />“Aya do, kono ceng atye kit ma abedo kwede ikare macon ca,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:2">ma Lubanga obedo kagwoka!<verse eid="JOB 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 29:3" />Ikare meno tarane obedo kalyel malo ka wiya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:3">dero pa Lubanga obedo kamenya ka awoto i piny macol.<verse eid="JOB 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 29:4" />Ikare meno onongo lima tye kamede ameda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:4">ki mar pa Lubanga bene ogwoko ganga.<verse eid="JOB 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 29:5" />Won Twer Ducu onongo tye kweda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:5">onongo lutinona bene gurumu kangeta woko.<verse eid="JOB 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 29:6" />Kama acito iye ducu onongo anongo cak mabup,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:6">onongo anongo moo madwong wa ikom yadi ma apito ikin gweng!<verse eid="JOB 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 29:7" />Ka yam acito i dog gang kama ludongo gicoke iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:7">ci onongo ayubu kabedona i dye gang kama kiporo iye lok,<verse eid="JOB 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 29:8" />ka yam awobe gunena ci onongo gidire woko cen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:8">ludongo onongo gia malo gicung acunga;<verse eid="JOB 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 29:9" />rwodi bene onongo gijuku lokgi woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:9">kun giketo cinggi idoggi;<verse eid="JOB 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 29:10" />dwon ludito onongo ling woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:10">wek giwiny lok ma a ki idoga.<verse eid="JOB 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 29:11" />Dano ma onena onyo owinyo lok koma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:11">nongo tye ki caden me gin maber ma atimo.<verse eid="JOB 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 29:12" />Pien onongo akonyo lucan ka gukok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:12">dok akonyo lutino kic ma lukonygi peke.<verse eid="JOB 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 29:13" />Jo ma onongo gitye ki can gilegga gum,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:13">dok amiyo mon to bene gunongo yomcwiny.<verse eid="JOB 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 29:14" />Onongo aruke ki kit ma atir macalo ruka me kare ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:14">onongo anyebe ki ngolo kop kakare macalo jor ki tok wic ma aruku.<verse eid="JOB 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 29:15" />Yam onongo abedo macalo wang lutowang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:15">ki tyen lungolo.<verse eid="JOB 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 29:16" />Yam bene onongo akonyo lucan macalo gin lutinona kikome;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:16">kadi dano ma onongo pe angeyo, yam acung pire i pidone.<verse eid="JOB 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 29:17" />Onongo alwenyo matek ki lubwami macalo alwenyo ki nguu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:17">dok alaro dano ki botgi macalo alaro ki i dog labwor.<verse eid="JOB 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 29:18" />Yam onongo atamo ni abito ki kuc i pacona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:18">ki bene onongo atamo ni abirii iwi lobo,<verse eid="JOB 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 29:19" />ma nongo arom ki yat ma lwite ojar inget pii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:19">ma toyo luk i jange dyewor benebene,<verse eid="JOB 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 29:20" />kun deyona pe rweny ki bota,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:20">dok tekona roc doko nyen kare ki kare.<verse eid="JOB 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 29:21" />Dano yam winyo tama ci giling mot;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:21">kun gikuru tam ma an aye amiyo botgi.<verse eid="JOB 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 29:22" />Onongo ka dong aloko, pe dok kiloko lok mo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:22">loka onongo obedo macalo kot ma cwer.<verse eid="JOB 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 29:23" />Onongo gibedo kakuru loka macalo kikuru poto kot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:23">onongo kigamo tama macalo lapur jolo kot me cwir.<verse eid="JOB 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 29:24" />Onongo abunyu botgi kadi gipeke ki gen mo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:24">ci bunyuna onongo miyo ki gin yomcwiny.<verse eid="JOB 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 29:25" />Yam anyutigi gin ma myero gutim, kun abedo macalo rwotgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:25">nyo macalo rwot ma bedo i dye monye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:25">ki ngat ma kweyo cwiny jo matye kakumu.”<verse eid="JOB 29:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JOB 30" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 30:1" />Yubu omede ki lok kun waco ni, “Ento kombedi dong kitye kanyera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:1">jo ma pud lutino ki tung bota,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:1">ma wegigi yam acayogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:1">ma onongo pe atwero ketogi wa ikin gwogi ma gikuru romina.<verse eid="JOB 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 30:2" />Kit kony ango ma onongo atwero nongo ki ikom teko me badgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:2">gin jo ma kero komgi dong otum wokoni?<verse eid="JOB 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 30:3" />Jo ma lucan ma kec nekogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:3">gin nyamo lwit yen i tim kama dano peke iye.<verse eid="JOB 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 30:4" />Gingwedo pot yat me tim ki oboke me bunga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:4">ki giboko lwit lyono me acamagi.<verse eid="JOB 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 30:5" />Yam kiryemogi woko ki ikin dano;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:5">kidange ikorgi macalo kidange ikor lakwo.<verse eid="JOB 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 30:6" />Yam gibedo i ora kulu kama rac,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:6">ki i bur ma i ngom nyo i boro got.<verse eid="JOB 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 30:7" />Yam gikok ki i bunga macalo lee tim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:7">gigure kacel ite okutu.<verse eid="JOB 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 30:8" />Gin jo ma kitgi racu ma pe kimarogi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:8">ma kiryemogi woko ki i lobowa.<verse eid="JOB 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 30:9" />Ento kombedi dong gucako wer ikoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:9">nyinga odoko lok aboka ki tung botgi.<verse eid="JOB 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 30:10" />Gidaga, ma gibedo kweda anyeda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:10">gingulu laa wa iwanga.<verse eid="JOB 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 30:11" />Pien Lubanga obalo tekona woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:11">oweko gumuke ikoma ki kerogi ducu.<verse eid="JOB 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 30:12" />Lwakgi otware ikoma ki tung acuc,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:12">ci gucako ryema woko cut,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:12">kun giyenyo yo me kelo can ikoma.<verse eid="JOB 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 30:13" />Gubalo yoo ma kono aringo alare kwede,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:13">gimedo can ikoma ameda;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:13">kun ngat ma jukugi peke.<verse eid="JOB 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 30:14" />Gumuku wang cel malac, ci gukati ikoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:14">gibedo ni kelkel iwi obur.<verse eid="JOB 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 30:15" />Lworo obango koma woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:15">deyona otum woko macalo gin ma yamo okolo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:15">gum ducu ma anongo bene orwenyo woko macalo pol.<verse eid="JOB 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 30:16" />Kombedi dong acok to woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:16">agiki me arem ma ikoma peke.<verse eid="JOB 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 30:17" />Cogo koma mwode amwoda i dyewor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:17">awinyo arem ma pe aywe.<verse eid="JOB 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 30:18" />Lubanga omako ngut ginarukana ki tek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:18">ci odeya woko ki ngut kanyina.<verse eid="JOB 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 30:19" />Obola woko piny i daba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:19">adoko calo apwa ki buru.<verse eid="JOB 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 30:20" />Lubanga, abedo kakok boti, ci pe igamo doga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:20">acung kalega ento pe iketo cwinyi iye.<verse eid="JOB 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 30:21" />Dong iloke idoko ger woko ikoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:21">itye kauna ki teki ducu.<verse eid="JOB 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 30:22" />Imiyo yamo tinga malo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:22">yamo kot ma mor mager tye kabola atata.<verse eid="JOB 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 30:23" />Eyo, angeyo ni ibitera i to,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:23">kama jo makwo ducu o iye.<verse eid="JOB 30:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 30:24" />Pingo ilwenyo ki ngat ma piny oloyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:24">ma pe twero timo gin mo ma pat ki tango cinge me kwayo kica?<verse eid="JOB 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 30:25" />Nene pe akok pi jo matye i peko?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:25">Cwinya bene pe ocwer pi jo ma piny obwoyogi?<verse eid="JOB 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 30:26" />Ento ka nene abedo kageno ni abibedo maber,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:26">ci nen gin marac aye ocako bino;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:26">ikare ma ageno ni piny bibedo leng, colpiny aye obino.<verse eid="JOB 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 30:27" />Cwinya obedo kapoto, ci pe omedo ki kwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:27">kare me aroma keken aye dong tye inyima.<verse eid="JOB 30:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 30:28" />Awire ma cwinya otur,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:28">ento ngat mo ma kweyo cwinya peke; aa malo i kacoke akok pi kony.<verse eid="JOB 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 30:29" />Too gudoko omegina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:29">ki udu bene gudoko luwota.<verse eid="JOB 30:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 30:30" />Del koma ocido woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:30">ci ware woko awara ki ikoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:30">cogona tye ka wange awanga.<verse eid="JOB 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 30:31" />Dwon opuka dong odoko wer me kumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:31">ki dwon nyamulerena winye calo dwon dano ma kok.<verse eid="JOB 30:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JOB 31" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 31:1" />Atyeko kwongo kwong wa con, wan ki wanga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:1">ni pe dong abineno nyako mo ki wang me miti.<verse eid="JOB 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 31:2" />Gin ango ma Lubanga matye malo timo bota?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:2">Won Twer Ducu matye i polo miya gin ango me ginaleyana?<verse eid="JOB 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 31:3" />Onongo yam atamoni can poto ikom lubalo aye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:3">dok ni keckom mako lutim maracu keken.<verse eid="JOB 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 31:4" />I ada Lubanga neno kit kwona ducu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:4">dok kwano wel tyena ma akalo ducu.<verse eid="JOB 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 31:5" />Ka yam abedo kaloko lok goba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:5">ka yam koma obedo mit kabumu dano;<verse eid="JOB 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 31:6" />ci wek Lubanga opima ki mijan ma pimo kakare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:6">ka wek Lubanga onge ni cwinya leng.<verse eid="JOB 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 31:7" />Ka yam tyena ongak woko ki i yo pa Lubanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:7">ka yam cwinya oparo pi gin ma aneno,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:7">ka yam ton me bal mo onen i cinga;<verse eid="JOB 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 31:8" />ci wek jo mukene aye gucam gin ma an acoyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:8">gin ma ocek i potona myero guput woko.<verse eid="JOB 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 31:9" />Ka cwinya yam otera ikom dako mo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:9">ci akane inget dogola pa lawota,<verse eid="JOB 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 31:10" />ci wek dakona oreg bel pi laco mukene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:10">wek ngat mukene aye obut kwede.<verse eid="JOB 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 31:11" />Kono meno onongo obedo bal marac atika;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:11">ma lungolkop myero gungola pwod pire.<verse eid="JOB 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 31:12" />Ci tim kwelena omyero obed mac ma wanga nakanaka nio wa i bur lyel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:12">ma wango wa lwit cam ki i potona woko ducu.<verse eid="JOB 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 31:13" />Ka onongo tye ada ni ceng akwero pido pa opiina nyo angecana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:13">ikare ma gukelo cwercwinygi ikoma,<verse eid="JOB 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 31:14" />ci abitimo gin ango ka Lubanga ocung pi ngolo kop ikoma?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:14">Ka en obino pi penyo loke ci abigamo doge ningning?<verse eid="JOB 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 31:15" />Pe ngat ma ocweya i maa en aye ma ocweyo opiina bene?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:15">Pe ngat acel aye ma ocweyowa ki i ic?<verse eid="JOB 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 31:16" />Yam pe atwono lucan ki gin mo ma gimito,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:16">pe bene amiyo mon to gukuru kony ki bota kwe.<verse eid="JOB 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 31:17" />Ceng pe acamo cama kena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:17">dok pe atwono latin kic mo cam,<verse eid="JOB 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 31:18" />pien nia wa iwang tinona abedo kagwoko lutino kic calo an awon gi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:18">dok nicake ki i maa an abedo kakonyo mon to.<verse eid="JOB 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 31:19" />Ka ceng abedo kaneno anena ngat mo ma mito to pi can bongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:19">nyo dano ma lacan obedo labongo gium, ma pe akonye,<verse eid="JOB 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 31:20" />ka ceng pe olegga gum,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:20">pien pe amiye bongo me yer romo mapek pi miye lyeto;<verse eid="JOB 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 31:21" />ka yam atingo cinga pi goyo latin kic mo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:21">pien angeyo ni kitwero konya wek alo kop;<verse eid="JOB 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 31:22" />ka yam atimo kitmeno ci myero akwaya bada oput woko ki iwi gwoka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:22">ci myero kiput bada ki iwang mwote woko.<verse eid="JOB 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 31:23" />Pien yam onongo alworo can ma a ki bot Lubanga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:23">pe atimo meno ducu, pi woro dite ki deyone.<verse eid="JOB 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 31:24" />Ka yam amoko gena ikom lonyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:24">nyo ajenge ikom lonyo me jabuna;<verse eid="JOB 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 31:25" />ka ceng cwinya obedo yom pi lonyona mabup,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:25">nyo pien acoko gipiny mapol;<verse eid="JOB 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 31:26" />ka yam aneno ceng ka ryeny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:26">nyo dwe kun woto ki deyo madit,<verse eid="JOB 31:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 31:27" />ma dok aweko kibita me worogi i mung,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:27">kun akulu wiya piny pi worogi.<verse eid="JOB 31:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 31:28" />Meno bene kono onongo obedo bal ma lungolkop myero gungola pwod iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:28">pien nongo adoko lagoba bot Lubanga matye malo.<verse eid="JOB 31:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 31:29" />Yam pe abedo ki yomcwiny ka keckom omako lakwora,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:29">pe anyate ka gin marac opoto ikome.<verse eid="JOB 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 31:30" />Yam pe aweko doga obalo bal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:30">kun alego pi tone.<verse eid="JOB 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 31:31" />Jo ma i oda yam guwaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:31">‘Anga ma pe oyeng ki ringo lee ma laditwa oneko?’<verse eid="JOB 31:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 31:32" />Larok mo pe yam obutu i dye gang ata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:32">pien yam ajolo luwot ducu i oda.<verse eid="JOB 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 31:33" />Yam pe amungu gin marac ma atimo calo jo mukene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:33">kun akano bala i cwinya kena,<verse eid="JOB 31:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 31:34" />pi lworo lok pa lwak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:34">Yam pe aling mot kun pe akato woko ki i oda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:34">pi lworo cac pa jo me dogola mukene.<verse eid="JOB 31:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 31:35" />Kono nene ngat ma winyo loka tye!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:35">Nen, dong akwonge ni lok ma alokoni kakare!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:35">Wek Won Twer Ducu ogam loka.<verse eid="JOB 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 31:36" />Kono lakwora ocoyo lok ma odota kwede acoya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:36">kono anyate kwede ma nongo atingo iwi gwoka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:36">nyo adwalo iwiya macalo lalukana.<verse eid="JOB 31:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 31:37" />Kono atite gin ducu kikore,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:37">kun anyiko cok kwede calo abedo laker.<verse eid="JOB 31:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 31:38" />Ka yam lobo ma apuru okok ikoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:38">ma kokone winye ikor kweri pa lapur;<verse eid="JOB 31:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 31:39" />ka yam acamo cam ma ocek labongo culu wange,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:39">kun aweko wegine guto ki kec;<verse eid="JOB 31:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 31:40" />ci wek i potona okutu odong iye ma ka ngano ki cayiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:40">ki doo ma ngwece coo ma ka cayiri.”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JOB 31:40" />
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 31:40">Lok ma Yubu oloko ogik kany.<verse eid="JOB 31:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JOB 32" />
  <para style="s1">Acaki lok pa Eliu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 32:1" />Jo meno adeki guweko gamo dog Yubu pien Yubu onongo tamoni kite tye atir. <verse eid="JOB 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 32:2" />Lacen Eliu wod pa Barakel ma jo Buj, me dogola pa Ram, okeco ikom Yubu. En okeco ikom Yubu pi tamo ni en aye loke tye atir, pe Lubanga. <verse eid="JOB 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 32:3" />En bene okeco ikom lurem Yubu adeki, pien pe gunongo lagam mo, kadi bed ceng gutito ni Yubu aye oroco. <verse eid="JOB 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 32:4" />Eliu kong okuru ka co adeki guloko ki Yubu, pien onongo gutegi makato en. <verse eid="JOB 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 32:5" />Ento ka en oneno ni gamo dog Yubu oloyo co adeki, kiniga ocako make.<verse eid="JOB 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 32:6" />Eliu ma wod pa Barakel ma jo Buj owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:6">“An pud latin, wun dong wutegi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:6">pimeno abedo ki lworo me tito ki wun gin ma atamo.<verse eid="JOB 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 32:7" />Onongo atamo ni, ‘Wek ludito aye guloki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:7">wek ludito me mwaka gunywak ryekogi.’<verse eid="JOB 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 32:8" />Ento cwiny matye i dano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:8">ma yweyo pa Won Twer Ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:8">aye gin mamiyo dano niang ilok moni.<verse eid="JOB 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 32:9" />Man teloke ni pe tiyo aye weko dano bedo ryek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:9">nyo ni jo ma otegi aye gingeyo gin matye atir.<verse eid="JOB 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 32:10" />Pimeno awaco ni wuwiny loka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:10">wek an bene anyut tama.<verse eid="JOB 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 32:11" />Nen, abedo kakuru lok ma wuwaco,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:11">aciko ita wek awiny ryeko ma wubedo kalokone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:11">kun wuyenyo kit lok ma myero wuwac.<verse eid="JOB 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 32:12" />Onongo aketo cwinya kawinyo lokwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:12">ci nen, onongo pe tye ngat mo ikinwu ma onyutu ni lok pa Yubu pe tye atir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:12">nyo ma ogamo lok doge kakare.<verse eid="JOB 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 32:13" />Wugwoke, wuwek waco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:13">‘Wan dong walimo ryeko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:13">Lubanga aye twero juku Yubu, pe dano.’<verse eid="JOB 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 32:14" />Ka onongo Yubu obedo kacero lok ki an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:14">kono onongo pe agamo doge ki kit lok macalo mewuni.<verse eid="JOB 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 32:15" />Doggi otwo woko, pe dong gitwero gamo dogi Yubu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:15">pien pe gitye ki lok mo ma myero guwaci.<verse eid="JOB 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 32:16" />Itamoni an myero kong akurgi kun gin dong pe gitwero lok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:16">ma gin ducu dong gucung acunga, ma pe gitwero gamo lok mo?<verse eid="JOB 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 32:17" />An ki tung bota abigamo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:17">dok abinyutu tama bene.<verse eid="JOB 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 32:18" />Pien atye ki lwak lok mapol, cwinya tye karuya ni aloki.<verse eid="JOB 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 32:19" />Nen, cwinya tye macalo kongo bwino ma kiumu wiye woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:19">calo kicaa kongo bwino manyen ma mito yec.<verse eid="JOB 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 32:20" />Myero aloki, wek aywe maber;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:20">myero olo to angam doga, agam loke.<verse eid="JOB 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 32:21" />Pe abicwako kor dano mo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:21">pe abidworo kor dano mo bene.<verse eid="JOB 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 32:22" />An pe angeyo kit me dworo kor dano;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:22">ka awaco ni atem, ci Lacwec myero otugi neka woko cut.<verse eid="JOB 32:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JOB 33" />
  <para style="s1">Eliu ojuku Yubu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 33:1" />Ento kombedi dong in Yubu, iwiny loka maber,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:1">cik itii ikom lok ducu ma abiwaco.<verse eid="JOB 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 33:2" />Nen, dong angamo doga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:2">leba dong ocako lok.<verse eid="JOB 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 33:3" />Loka nyutu ni cwinya tye atir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:3">aloko gin ma angeyo ni tye atir.<verse eid="JOB 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 33:4" />Cwiny pa Lubanga aye ma ocweya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:4">ki yweyo pa Won Twer Ducu aye omiyo atye makwo.”<verse eid="JOB 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 33:5" />Gam doga, kace itwero,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:5">can loki ducu kikore inyima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:5">nong kom lok ma icung iye.<verse eid="JOB 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 33:6" />Nen, arom kwedi inyim Lubanga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:6">an bene kicweya ki lobo.<verse eid="JOB 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 33:7" />Pe myero ibed ki lworo pi neno an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:7">loka pe binuri ma okato kakare.<verse eid="JOB 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 33:8" />Adada, ityeko loko lok kun awinyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:8">dong awinyo lok ma iwaco.<verse eid="JOB 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 33:9" />Ceng iwaco ni, “An aleng, bal mo peke ikoma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:9">cwinya leng, dok pe atimo gin mo marac.”<verse eid="JOB 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 33:10" />Ento Lubanga tye kayenyo lok ikoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:10">en tima macalo lakwore.<verse eid="JOB 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 33:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 13:27">Yub 13:27</ref>
      </char>
    </note> En otweyo tyena ki nyor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:11">en ngiyo kama acito iye ducu.<verse eid="JOB 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 33:12" />Ento Yubu, pien iloko kitmeno in dong i poto i bal.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:12">Ma omiyo an agamo kumeno, Lubanga aye dit makato dano.<verse eid="JOB 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 33:13" />Pingo imito pyem kwede kun iwaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:13">“Pe ogamo lwak lokani wa ki acel”?<verse eid="JOB 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 33:14" />Lubanga loko i yo mapatpat,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:14">ento dano pe niang i loke.<verse eid="JOB 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 33:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 4:13">Yub 4:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Lubanga loko iwang lek, i ginanyuta me dyewor, ka dano onino matek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:15">kun nino oyutu wanggi ki i kabutugi.<verse eid="JOB 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 33:16" />Meno aye kare ma en loko kwede ki i it dano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:16">ci ryango komgi ki lok me jukugi,<verse eid="JOB 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 33:17" />wek emii danonu oloke, owek timo tice marac,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:17">dok wek ekwany wake woko ki i cwiny danonu.<verse eid="JOB 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 33:18" />Kumeno en gwoko dano wek pe oto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:18">en gwoko kwone, wek pe ongol kulu me to.<verse eid="JOB 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 33:19" />Lubanga pwodo dano bene ki arem i kabutune,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:19">kun miyo kome rem kare ducu,<verse eid="JOB 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 33:20" />mamiyo cwinye dag cam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:20">iye kwero wa cam mamit woko.<verse eid="JOB 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 33:21" />Kome mok ma ringo kome pe dong nen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:21">cogone mayam pe nen kamaleng cako nen.<verse eid="JOB 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 33:22" />Nongo en dong cok cito piny i bur lyel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:22">kwone dong cok poto i cing lunek dano.<verse eid="JOB 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 33:23" />Gwok onyo ka lamalaika mo tye ma cung pire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:23">ma ngat acel ikin lumalaika alip ki alip, ma kubu kin Lubanga ki dano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:23">ma nyutu bot dano gin ma myero otim,<verse eid="JOB 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 33:24" />ci lamalaika twero time kica kun waco bot Lubanga ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:24">“Weke, wek en pe ocit piny i bur,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:24">pien dong anongo gin lakok kwone.<verse eid="JOB 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 33:25" />Wek ringo kome oroc, odok nyen macalo pa latin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:25">wek tekone odwog macalo ikare me awobine.”<verse eid="JOB 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 33:26" />Ka man otime, ci dano man bilego Lubanga, ci Lubanga bigamo legane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:26">ci dano meno bicako bino inyim Lubanga ki yom cwiny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:26">ci Lubanga bicule pi kite ma atir.<verse eid="JOB 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 33:27" />En biwer inyim lwak kun waco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:27">“Nene abalo, angak woko aweko timo gin matye atir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:27">ento Lubanga pe opwoda marom ki tim ma atimo.<verse eid="JOB 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 33:28" />En okoka, pe dong abicito piny ikin jo ma oto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:28">pud abibedo kwo ma aneno ceng.”<verse eid="JOB 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 33:29" />Nen, Lubanga tiyo meno ducu bot dano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:29">en tiyo meno kare ki kare<verse eid="JOB 33:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 33:30" />pi laro en ki i to,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:30">wek en obed ki yomcwiny me bedo kwo.<verse eid="JOB 33:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 33:31" />Cik iti, in Yubu, wek iwiny loka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:31">ling mot, wek an aloki.<verse eid="JOB 33:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 33:32" />Ka itye ki lok mo me awaca, gam doga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:32">loki, pien cwinya bibedo yom kace onen ni loki tye atir.<verse eid="JOB 33:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 33:33" />Ento ka pe, winy loka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:33">ling mot, ci abipwonyi ki ryeko.<verse eid="JOB 33:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JOB 34" />
  <para style="s1">Eliu omede ki loke</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 34:1" />Eliu omede ki lok kun waco ni,<verse eid="JOB 34:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 34:2" />“Wuwiny loka, wun luryeko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:2">wucik itwu ka aloko, wun jo matye ki ngec.<verse eid="JOB 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 34:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 12:11">Yub 12:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Dano bilo dek mamit ki lebe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:3">ento yero lok mamit ki ite.<verse eid="JOB 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 34:4" />Wek wayer gin matye atir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:4">wek waniang ikinwa kekenwa lok mene matye kakare.<verse eid="JOB 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 34:5" />Pien Yubu owaco ni, ‘An apeke ki bal mo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:5">dok Lubanga okwero ngola kop atir.<verse eid="JOB 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 34:6" />Kadi bed loka tye atir, pud kiwaco ni an lagoba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:6">ret ma kiketo ikoma pe twero cang, kadi bed pe abalo bal mo.’<verse eid="JOB 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 34:7" />Tika tye dano mo macalo Yubu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:7">Ma yeto dano yot bote calo mato pii.<verse eid="JOB 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 34:8" />En omako lurem ki lutim aranyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:8">dok woto kacel ki jo maracu.<verse eid="JOB 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 34:9" />Pien en owaco ni, ‘Konye peke bot dano mo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:9">me tiyo gin ma yomo cwiny Lubanga.’<verse eid="JOB 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 34:10" />Pimeno wuwiny loka, wun jo matye ki niang matut,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:10">Lubanga pe twero timo gin marac kadi ki acel.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:10">Won Twer Ducu pe timo gin mo ma pe tye atir.<verse eid="JOB 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 34:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 62:12">Jab 62:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pien en culu dano marom ki kit gin ma en otimo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:11">en timo dano acel acel ma oporo kit kwone.<verse eid="JOB 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 34:12" />Ada, Lubanga pe timo gin mo marac,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:12">Won Twer Ducu pe ngolo kop alenga.<verse eid="JOB 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 34:13" />Anga mayam omiyo twero ki Lubanga?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:13">Anga ma ceng oketo lobo ducu ni Lubanga oloo?<verse eid="JOB 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 34:14" />Ka Lubanga odwoko yamone me kwo ducu bote,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:14">ma oguru yweyone ducu bote kene,<verse eid="JOB 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 34:15" />man onongo miyo gin makwo ducu to woko lawangacel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:15">ci dano dok gire i apwa.<verse eid="JOB 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 34:16" />Ka itye ki niang matut, ci winy loka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:16">ci cik iti iloka ma awaconi.<verse eid="JOB 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 34:17" />Itamoni ngat ma dag ngolo kop atir twero bedo laloc?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:17">Dok itamoni ngat ma kite atir, ma en aye won twero bene, iwaco ni kite rac?<verse eid="JOB 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 34:18" />Lubanga ngolo kop bot rwot ni, ‘In konyi peke,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:18">dok waco bot laker ni, ‘In idano marac.’<verse eid="JOB 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 34:19" />Lubanga pe dworo kor luker,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:19">pe paro pi lulonyo makato pi lucan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:19">pien gin ducu en ma ocweyogi ki cinge.<verse eid="JOB 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 34:20" />I dakika acel keken gito woko i cwiny dyewor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:20">Lubanga goyowa ci wa to woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:20">dok neko dano matek labongo lageng mo.<verse eid="JOB 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 34:21" />En ciko wange pi neno gin ma dano tiyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:21">ci neno kama en cito iye ducu.<verse eid="JOB 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 34:22" />Pe tye mutu mo nyo piny ma ocido licuc</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:22">ma lutim maracu gitwero kane iye.<verse eid="JOB 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 34:23" />Lubanga pe omoko kare ki dano mo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:23">me cito inyime wek engol kop ikome.<verse eid="JOB 34:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 34:24" />En turu dit pa wegi twer labongo yenyo telokgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:24">ci keto jo mukene iwi komgi.<verse eid="JOB 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 34:25" />Pien Lubanga ngeyo ticgi con,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:25">retogi piny i dyewor ci tyekogi woko.<verse eid="JOB 34:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 34:26" />En pwodogi pi rac kitgi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:26">ki inyim lwak,<verse eid="JOB 34:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 34:27" />pien onongo gubare woko ki kalubu kore,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:27">pe dong guketo cwinygi katimo kit ma Lubanga mito.<verse eid="JOB 34:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 34:28" />Kitgi omiyo koko pa lucan oo wa bot Lubanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:28">ci en owinyo koko pa jo ma kiunugi.<verse eid="JOB 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 34:29" />Ka Lubanga obedo mot, anga ma waco ni en otimo bal?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:29">Ka okano wange woko, anga matwero nene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:29">kadi rok mo onyo kadi dano mo?<verse eid="JOB 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 34:30" />En gengo dano ma pe gilworo Lubanga me bedo luloc,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:30">wek pe gubed macalo owic ki bot lwak.<verse eid="JOB 34:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 34:31" />Yubu in mono dong ityeko tucu bali bot Lubanga kun iwaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:31">‘Apoto i bal, ento pe dok abitimo gin marac,<verse eid="JOB 34:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 34:32" />nyuta bala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:32">ka yam abalo, pe dok abinwoyo timo aye’?<verse eid="JOB 34:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 34:33" />In itamoni myero Lubanga otimi gin ma in imito</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:33">in ngat ma idag gin ma Lubanga otimoni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:33">In myero iyer, ento pe an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:33">pimeno tit gin ma ingeyo.<verse eid="JOB 34:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 34:34" />Jo maryek ma giniang lok</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:34">ka guwinyo loka gibiwaco bota ni,<verse eid="JOB 34:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 34:35" />‘Yubu tye kalok labongo ngec mo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:35">loke ryeko peke iye matwal.’<verse eid="JOB 34:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 34:36" />Cwinya onongo mito ni kono kong kitemo Yubu nio wa i agiki me tekone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:36">pien lagam ma mere obedo lagam pa jo maracu.<verse eid="JOB 34:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 34:37" />Yubu lacere, pud mede ameda i bal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:37">dok dongo cinge ikinwu pi cayo Lubanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:37">dok nyayo loke me cac.”<verse eid="JOB 34:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JOB 35" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 35:1" />Eliu omede ki loke kun waco ni,<verse eid="JOB 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 35:2" />“Yubu, onongo itamo ni lok ma ilokoni tye atir?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:2">Ma iwaco ni i peke ki bal mo inyim Lubanga.<verse eid="JOB 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 35:3" />Ka ipenyo Lubanga ni, ‘Kony ango ma dong anongo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:3">Gin ango maber ma abinongo ka pe atimo bal?’<verse eid="JOB 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 35:4" />Abigamo loki kit man,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:4">in kacel ki luremi.<verse eid="JOB 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 35:5" />Nen polo ci ingii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:5">nen pol ma gitye lamal makato in.<verse eid="JOB 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 35:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 22:2-3">Yub 22:2-3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ka ibalo, meno pe timo gin mo ikom Lubanga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:6">Kadi ka inyayo bal mapol, ci itamoni bitimo gin ango ikom Lubanga?<verse eid="JOB 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 35:7" />Ka timi tye atir, nongo imiyo gin ango bote?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:7">Onyo gin ango ma en gamo ki i cingi?<verse eid="JOB 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 35:8" />Timi marac gudu dano marom ki in,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:8">timi ma atir bene itimo bot dano.<verse eid="JOB 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 35:9" />Dano gikok pi aroma mapol ma kiunugi kwede,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:9">gikok pi kony wek kilargi ki itwero pa jo mategu ma unugi.<verse eid="JOB 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 35:10" />Ento pe tye ngat mo ma penyo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:10">‘Lubanga ma ocweya tye kwene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:10">en ngat mamiyo dano wero wer me pake wa i dyewor,<verse eid="JOB 35:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 35:11" />en ngat ma pwonyowa makato lee ma iwi lobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:11">ci miyo wabedo ryek makato winyo me polo?’<verse eid="JOB 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 35:12" />Gikok bote ki kunu, ento en pe gamo doggi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:12">pi wake pa jo maracu.<verse eid="JOB 35:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 35:13" />Adada, Lubanga pe winyo koko ma tere peke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:13">dok bene Won Twer Ducu pe keto iye cwinye.<verse eid="JOB 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 35:14" />In Yubu dong loki bibedo ningning, in ngat ma iwaco ni pe ineno Lubanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:14">dok ni ibibedo kakure mot</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:14">pien dong kopi tye inyime me angola!<verse eid="JOB 35:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 35:15" />Dok in itamo ni ka kiniga omake pe keto can ikom dano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:15">dok ni pe paro tutwal pi tim aranyi.<verse eid="JOB 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 35:16" />Pimeno konye peke in Yubu, me bedo kalok;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:16">man nyutu ni pe itye kangeyo gin ma iloko.”<verse eid="JOB 35:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JOB 36" />
  <para style="s1">Eliu opako dit pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 36:1" />Eliu omede ki loke kun waco ni,<verse eid="JOB 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 36:2" />“Dii cwinyi manok, wek kong awaci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:2">lok ma dok ikom Lubanga.<verse eid="JOB 36:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 36:3" />Atye ki ngec malac mada, ci abitic kwede,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:3">pi nyutu ni tim pa Lubanga ma ocweya tye atir.<verse eid="JOB 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 36:4" />Pien adada loka goba peke iye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:4">ngat matye kalok kwedini tye ki ngec ma oromo maber.<verse eid="JOB 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 36:5" />Nen, Lubanga tye ki twero, dok pe cayo ngat mo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:5">tekone ocung ikom ryekone matut.<verse eid="JOB 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 36:6" />En pe weko jo maracu bedo kwo nakanaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:6">ento ngolo kop kakare pi jo ma kiunugi.<verse eid="JOB 36:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 36:7" />En pe kwanyo wange woko ki ikom jo ma kitgi atir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:7">ento ketogi kaloc macalo luker,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:7">ci gibedo ki dit nakanaka.<verse eid="JOB 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 36:8" />Ento ka kitweyogi ki pingo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:8">ma ayelayela otweyogi macalo ogwil,<verse eid="JOB 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 36:9" />ci en nyutu botgi gin ma gutimo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:9">ki tim aranyigi ki kit ma guwake kwede.<verse eid="JOB 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 36:10" />En miyo giwinyo pwony ma mere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:10">ci cikogi ni guloke, guwek timo gin marac.<verse eid="JOB 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 36:11" />Ka guwinyo doge ce gucako tiyo gin ma en mito,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:11">ci gityeko kare me kwogi ducu ki yomcwiny kun gitye ki yomcwiny.<verse eid="JOB 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 36:12" />Ento ka gukwero winye, ci kinekogi woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:12">gito labongo niang tyenlok ma omiyo Lubanga okelo to ikomgi.<verse eid="JOB 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 36:13" />Jo ma pe lworo Lubanga ki i cwinygi gibedo ki kiniga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:13">pe gikok bote pi kony ka en otweyogi.<verse eid="JOB 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 36:14" />Gito ma pud gitino,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:14">kwogi tum woko pi timgi me lewic.<verse eid="JOB 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 36:15" />Ento Lubanga laro jo ma gineno can kun tiyo ki can gi me larogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:15">en yabo wang dano ki can ma poto ikomgi.<verse eid="JOB 36:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 36:16" />In Yubu, atamoni Lubanga mito kwanyo in woko ki i atwom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:16">me teri kama gin mo pe diyi iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:16">dok en bipongo mejani jwijwi ki cam mabeco tutwal.<verse eid="JOB 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 36:17" />Ento kombedi can ma kiketo ikom jo maracu opoto boti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:17">can ma kiketo pi ngolo kop ikomi dong omaki matek.<verse eid="JOB 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 36:18" />Gwoke wek ngat mo pe oywa tami ki lonyo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:18">pe iwek lim mabup me cam cana olok tami omiyi ingak woko.<verse eid="JOB 36:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 36:19" />Kokoni pi kony pe twero gengo aroma ma bino ikomi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:19">kadi wa teko me komi pe twero konyi.<verse eid="JOB 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 36:20" />Pe imit ni dyewor obin;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:20">meno aye kare ma rok mapol kibityekogi woko ki i kabedogi.<verse eid="JOB 36:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 36:21" />Gwoke, pe iloke katimo bal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:21">pien Lubanga okelo can ikomi wek ojuki ki itimo bal.<verse eid="JOB 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 36:22" />Nen, twer pa Lubanga dit tutwal;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:22">anga matye lapwony marom kwede?<verse eid="JOB 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 36:23" />Anga ma otyeko nyute gin ango ma myero en otim?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:23">Anga matwero waco bot Lubanga ni, ‘In itimo rac’!<verse eid="JOB 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 36:24" />Nino ducu wapake pi tice ma en tiyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:24">pimeno in bene myero ipake.<verse eid="JOB 36:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 36:25" />Jo ducu guneno gin ma en otimo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:25">ento kine mogo dano neno ki kamabor.<verse eid="JOB 36:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 36:26" />Adada Lubanga dit, wan pe wangeye kwicikwici;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:26">wel mwaka ma en orii kwede pe tate.<verse eid="JOB 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 36:27" />Pien en miyo pii duny dok malo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:27">ci tono lupuune calo kot.<verse eid="JOB 36:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 36:28" />Kot core piny ki i pol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:28">ci cwer ikom dano madwong atika.<verse eid="JOB 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 36:29" />Tye ngat mo ma twero niang kit ma pol giyare kwede,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:29">nyo kit ma kot mor kwede i kema pa Lubanga?<verse eid="JOB 36:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 36:30" />En miyo lutkot wil tungi ki tungi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:30">ci menyo te nam woko.<verse eid="JOB 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 36:31" />Kitmeno en pito jo me rok ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:31">kun miyogi cam madwong tutwal.<verse eid="JOB 36:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 36:32" />En mako lutkot ki cinge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:32">ci ciko ni myero ocel kama kicimo.<verse eid="JOB 36:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 36:33" />Mor me kot tito pi Lubanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:33">ci dyangi gingeyo ni kot tye kabino.<verse eid="JOB 36:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JOB 37" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 37:1" />Mor pa kot miyo cwinya poto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:1">ma adununa mito tinge woko ki i kabedone.<verse eid="JOB 37:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 37:2" />Wuwiny mor me dwone</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:2">ki dange ma kati ki idoge.<verse eid="JOB 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 37:3" />En cwalo mor kot ite polo ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:3">lutkote wil wa itwok lobo ducu.<verse eid="JOB 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 37:4" />Lacen dwone cako mor;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:4">mor winye malongo macalo dwon laker;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:4">pe juku wil kot ikare ma dwone pud winye.<verse eid="JOB 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 37:5" />Lubanga miyo dwone mor ikit me aura;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:5">en tiyo jami madongo ma wan pe waromo niang iye.<verse eid="JOB 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 37:6" />En ciko pee ni opot i ngom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:6">dok ciko kot wek ocore madwong tutwal.<verse eid="JOB 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 37:7" />En juku dano pe tiyo tic mo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:7">wek jo ducu ma en ocweyo gunge tice.<verse eid="JOB 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 37:8" />Ci lee tim ducu gidok i kakanegi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:8">gibedo mot i borogi.<verse eid="JOB 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 37:9" />Lapiru a ki i ode,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:9">ki yamo ma kodo a tung kupiny kelo koyo ma ngic.<verse eid="JOB 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 37:10" />Yweyo pa Lubanga miyo pii make doko pee;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:10">pii ma omare make ci doko tek.<verse eid="JOB 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 37:11" />En weko pii doko pol;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:11">ci lutkot wil meny ki i pol.<verse eid="JOB 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 37:12" />Gibedo kawire tungi ki tungi kun Lubanga aye telogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:12">pi cobo gin ducu ma en ocikogi kwede,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:12">iwi lobo ducu kama dano bedo iye.<verse eid="JOB 37:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 37:13" />Kine mogo Lubanga miyo kot cwer pi miyo pwod ki dano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:13">nyo pi konyo lobone, nyo pi nyutu mar mere ma pe loke.<verse eid="JOB 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 37:14" />Winy lok man, in Yubu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:14">cung mot ka itam pi tic me aura ma Lubanga timo.<verse eid="JOB 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 37:15" />Itamoni in ingeyo kit ma Lubanga miyo kwede cik,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:15">ci miyo lutkot meny ki i pol?<verse eid="JOB 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 37:16" />Itamoni in ingeyo kit ma pol ma mere lyere kwede?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:16">Meno aye tic me aura mada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:16">pa ngat ma dirone dwong ma okato kare.<verse eid="JOB 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 37:17" />In ngat ma iwinyo lyeto me bongini keken,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:17">ka yamo ma a ki tung kupiny miyo jami ducu cung mot,<verse eid="JOB 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 37:18" />in itamoni iromo yaro polo kit ma en otimoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:18">ma imiyo bedo matek macalo mola?<verse eid="JOB 37:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 37:19" />Pien wan pe watwero laro lok maber kwede;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:19">pi kwiya piny ma watye kwede.<verse eid="JOB 37:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 37:20" />Pe aromo penyo ni myero alok ki Lubanga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:20">pingo amito miye kare me tyeka woko?<verse eid="JOB 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 37:21" />Kombedi dong pe tye ngat mo matwero ciko wange kaneno ceng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:21">kun tye karyeny maleng tutwal i polo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:21">ma yamo dong okodo, ci pol oware woko.<verse eid="JOB 37:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 37:22" />Deyo ma mwunya nen kun tuc woko ki tung kumalo maryeny calo jabu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:22">Lubanga dong oruke ki deyone makelo lworo.<verse eid="JOB 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 37:23" />Twero pa Won Twer Ducu, dit ma pe waromo o cok bote;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:23">en tiyo i yo ma opore, dok ngolo kop atir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:23">time ducu tye atir ma pe unu dano mo.<verse eid="JOB 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 37:24" />Pimeno dano lwore;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:24">en pe paro pi jo ma gin tamo ni gin luryeko.”<verse eid="JOB 37:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JOB 38" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot Lubanga ogamo dog Yubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 38:1" />Rwot ogamo dog Yubu kun loko ki i yamo lapiru ni,<verse eid="JOB 38:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 38:2" />“Meno anga ma mito umu tama woko</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:2">kun loko loke labongo ngec mo?<verse eid="JOB 38:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 38:3" />Bed ma iyube macalo laco,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:3">abipenyi ci in aye igam doga.<verse eid="JOB 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 38:4" />Ikare ma acibo guti me te lobo onongo in mono itye kwene?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:4">Tita, ka itye ki niang matut.<verse eid="JOB 38:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 38:5" />Anga ma omoko kit ma bore ki lace bibedo kwede?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:5">Anga ma oryeyo tol me pimone?<verse eid="JOB 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 38:6" />Tedi tegutine kigurugi ikom gin ango?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:6">Anga ma ocibo got me twoke kakare,<verse eid="JOB 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 38:7" />ma onongo lakalatwe ducu me odiko giwero kacel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:7">ma lumalaika pa Lubanga ducu gidange ki yomcwiny?<verse eid="JOB 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 38:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 5:22">Jer 5:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Anga ma oketo kika me gengo nam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:8">ikare ma omwoc macalo pii me nyodo mamol?<verse eid="JOB 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 38:9" />An aye amiyo pol oumu nam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:9">aume woko ki pol ma ocido woko licuc.<verse eid="JOB 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 38:10" />Yam aketo wangco kama nam myero ogik iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:10">aketo dogola ma kicego ki rii me gengone,<verse eid="JOB 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 38:11" />kun awaco ni, ‘Ibio wa kany, ento pe ibikato,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:11">biamwonyini ma iwake kwedeni bigik kany.’<verse eid="JOB 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 38:12" />Yubu, ikare me kwoni ducu onongo yam in aye ma imiyo cik bot odiko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:12">kece onyo in aye ma inyutu ki rupiny kit me cako ninone?<verse eid="JOB 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 38:13" />Onongo in aye ma ipwonyo rupiny bo me romo i lobo woko ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:13">wek jo maracu guring gucit kama gikane iye?<verse eid="JOB 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 38:14" />Ka piny oru ci weko lobo loke woko, ci jami ducu cako nen kamaleng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:14">macalo lobo agulu ma lacwec diyo ajing<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:14 </char><char style="fk">Ajing </char> nyo Labiny obedo gin ma lacwe agulu deyo ki kom agulu nyo atabo lobo manongo pud dikdik. </note> ikome;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:14">ci tyenge bene cako nen calo tyeng ma ibongo aruka ma nen ma ngwalangwala.<verse eid="JOB 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 38:15" />Ci lengpiny pa jo maracu rwenyo woko ki botgi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:15">pe dong gitwero tingo badgi pi goyo dano.<verse eid="JOB 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 38:16" />Yam kong onongo io wa iwang it me nam ce?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:16">Yam kong onongo iwoto ki tyeni ite kut me nam wek irot ce?<verse eid="JOB 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 38:17" />Yam kong onongo kinyutu boti dogola me to,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:17">nyo ineno dogola me kabedo pa jo ma oto?<verse eid="JOB 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 38:18" />In itamoni iniang kit ma piny lac kwede?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:18">Waca meno ducu ka ingeyo.<verse eid="JOB 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 38:19" />Yone tye kwene ma o i kabedo makelo dero,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:19">ki mutu kono kabedone tye kwene?<verse eid="JOB 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 38:20" />Itwero nyutu botgi kama myero gin gugik iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:20">onyo itwero dwokogi cen i kabedogi?<verse eid="JOB 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 38:21" />In myero inge, pien mwakani dong pol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:21">pien ikare ma kicweyo lobo onongo dong kityeko nywali!<verse eid="JOB 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 38:22" />Yam idonyo i odi kama aketo iye pee mayom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:22">onyo kama akano iye pee matek calo gweng?<verse eid="JOB 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 38:23" />Ma an agwokogi pi kare me ayelayela,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:23">pi kare me lweny ki me mony?<verse eid="JOB 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 38:24" />Yoo mene ma cito dok tung kama kipoko iye dero,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:24">onyo kama yamo me kunyango kodo ki iye romo i lobo?<verse eid="JOB 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 38:25" />Anga mayam obaro wang lalele pi kot macore matek tutwal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:25">anga ma oyubu yoo pi lutkot wek owok ki iye?<verse eid="JOB 38:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 38:26" />Anga mamiyo kot cwer ata i lobo kama ngat mo peke iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:26">i tim kama dano pe bedo iye?<verse eid="JOB 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 38:27" />Anga ma cwalo kot cwer maromo i lobo matye aroo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:27">ci miyo lum twi dongo iye?<verse eid="JOB 38:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 38:28" />Kot tye mono ki wone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:28">kece onyo toyo tye ki wone?<verse eid="JOB 38:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 38:29" />Pee mine tye kwene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:29">anga ma min bwoyo pee ma opune i lobo, kun a ki i polo?<verse eid="JOB 38:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 38:30" />Anga ma weko pii make doko matek macalo got,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:30">ki pii ma i kut nam make woko liking?<verse eid="JOB 38:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 38:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 9:9">Yub 9:9</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 5:8">Amo 5:8</ref></char>
    </note>Itamoni in itwero tweyo Yoggo ki nyor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:31">nyo tuku ogwil ma kitweyo ki Lyernyim?<verse eid="JOB 38:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 38:32" />Itamoni in iromo nyutu ki oluma lakalatwe ma tung kumalo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:32">onyo matinone kitma myero gin guryeny kwede?<verse eid="JOB 38:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 38:33" />Itamoni in ingeyo cik ma kiloyo kwede ki polo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:33">itwero tic ki cikgi me loyo wi lobo kany?<verse eid="JOB 38:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 38:34" />Itamoni in itwero miyo dwoni winye wa i polo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:34">wek imii pii kot ocore, oumi woko?<verse eid="JOB 38:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 38:35" />Itamoni in itwero cwalo lutkot wek owil, tungi ki tungi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:35">ma en waco boti ni, ‘An ene, ora’?<verse eid="JOB 38:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 38:36" />Anga ma oketo ryeko tye i cwiny dano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:36">onyo anga ma omiyo ngec i adam pa dano,<verse eid="JOB 38:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 38:37" />anga matwero kwano wel pol ki ryekone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:37">onyo twero lengo dan polo wek kot ocwer,<verse eid="JOB 38:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 38:38" />ci miyo apwa doko daba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:38">ki ngom make kacel doko matek?<verse eid="JOB 38:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 38:39" />Itamoni in itwero dwaro lee pi labwor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:39">ci imiyo lutinone giyeng ki cam,<verse eid="JOB 38:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 38:40" />ma gukane i borogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:40">onyo ma gubutu mot kun gikengo lee me amaka?<verse eid="JOB 38:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOB 38:41" />Anga mamiyo cam bot agak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:41">ma nongo lutinone gikok bot Lubanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:41">kun gimal ata pi nok pa cam?<verse eid="JOB 38:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JOB 39" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 39:1" />Itamoni in ingeyo kare me nywal pa dyegi ma gibedo iwi godi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:1">Yam ineno ka til nywalo lutinogi?<verse eid="JOB 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 39:2" />Itamoni in ingeyo kwano wel dwe me durugi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:2">wek inge kare ma gibinywal iye.<verse eid="JOB 39:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 39:3" />Itamoni in ingeyo cawa ma giture kwede piny pi nywal kun gicole,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:3">ci ginywalo lutinogi?<verse eid="JOB 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 39:4" />Lutinogi dongo i bar ma komgi yot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:4">ci gicito gigi matwal ma pe dok gidwogo cen bot megigi.<verse eid="JOB 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 39:5" />Anga ma oweko kana me tim lone ken gi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:5">Anga ma ogonyogi me cito kama igi mito?<verse eid="JOB 39:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 39:6" />Atyeko miyogi aroo wek obed pacogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:6">ki lobo ma obedo punu wek gubed iye.<verse eid="JOB 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 39:7" />Pe gimito wo me taun madito,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:7">pe tye ngat mo ma burugi ma weko gitiyo tic.<verse eid="JOB 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 39:8" />Wi godi odoko oletgi ma gin wire iye ata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:8">kun giyenyo lum me acamagi.<verse eid="JOB 39:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 39:9" />Itamoni jubi biye tic mo piri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:9">onyo bibutu i dwoli i dyewor?<verse eid="JOB 39:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 39:10" />Itamoni in itwero tweyo jubi ikom kweri dyang wek opur potoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:10">onyo ni en bilubi kun loko potoni ma i lung?<verse eid="JOB 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 39:11" />Itamoni in ibigene ni pien tye ki teko madwong,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:11">ci ibiweko en tiyo tici ducu?<verse eid="JOB 39:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 39:12" />Igeno ni en bidwogo paco,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:12">ci kelo nganoni ilaro me adina?<verse eid="JOB 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 39:13" />Udu goyo bwome ki yomcwiny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:13">ento pe gitwero tuk calo winyo acebe ma lakicani.<verse eid="JOB 39:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 39:14" />Udu weko tonge i ngom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:14">wek lyeto me kweyo aye omur komgi.<verse eid="JOB 39:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 39:15" />Wiye wil woko, pe paro pi tonge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:15">pe paro ni lee tim mo twero nyonogi woko.<verse eid="JOB 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 39:16" />En tiyo ki lutinone ki gero,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:16">calo pe gubedo mere kikome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:16">en pe paro, kadi bed tonge bale nono;<verse eid="JOB 39:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 39:17" />pien an Lubanga atwone ryeko woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:17">pe amiye ryeko mo me niang.<verse eid="JOB 39:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 39:18" />Ka inen ocako ngwec,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:18">ci en nyero aguragura ki langwec kwede.<verse eid="JOB 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 39:19" />Yubu in aye ma imiyo tekkom ki aguragura bo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:19">In aye ma imiyo yer maboco tye ingute?<verse eid="JOB 39:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 39:20" />In aye ma imiyo pye calo bonyo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:20">Dok dange macalo won twer ci dano lworo?<verse eid="JOB 39:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 39:21" />En nyono piny i lung ma wake awaka pi tek kome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:21">ci ringo anyim ki kero kome ducu pi rwate ki tongi pa lulweny.<verse eid="JOB 39:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 39:22" />En peke ki lworo mo i cwinye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:22">pala lucwan bene pe miyo en loke dok cen.<verse eid="JOB 39:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 39:23" />Juru atero pa langwec kwede yenge makok ni tak tak tak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:23">ma tongine wil calo mac.<verse eid="JOB 39:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 39:24" />En ringo anyim oyot mada ki gero ki kiniga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:24">pe twero cung mot ka buriji okok.<verse eid="JOB 39:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 39:25" />Teki buriji okok, en bene kok ki yomcwiny;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:25">ngweyo ngwec lweny ki kamabor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:25">winyo dange pa lawi mony ki mwoc pa lulweny.<verse eid="JOB 39:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 39:26" />Itamoni pi ryekoni aye omiyo olwit tuk malo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:26">ka yaro bwome kemo tung kupiny?<verse eid="JOB 39:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 39:27" />In aye ma iciko ocur ni otuk malo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:27">wek oger ode lamal iwi got?<verse eid="JOB 39:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 39:28" />En bedo i pata got, dok butu kunu bene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:28">i kakanene matye i kor got ma ocule.<verse eid="JOB 39:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 39:29" />En ngiyo came wa ki kunu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:29">wange neno piny i ngom ki kamabor.<verse eid="JOB 39:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 39:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">39:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:28">Mat 24:28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:37">Luk 17:37</ref></char>
    </note> Lutinone ginongo remo me acwiya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:30">dok bene kama kom gin ma oto nonge iye, en pe rwenyo ki iye.”<verse eid="JOB 39:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JOB 40" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 40:1" />Rwot openyo Yubu ni,<verse eid="JOB 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 40:2" />“Itamoni lakwed te bal twero pido ki Won Twer Ducu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:2">In ma ipyem ki Lubanga, gam lok man.”<verse eid="JOB 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s">Lagam pa Yubu bot Lubanga</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 40:3" />Ci Yubu ogamo dog Lubanga kun waco ni,<verse eid="JOB 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 40:4" />“Nen ba, an pe a gin mo adada, ci abigamo loki ningning?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:4">Pe dong abingamo doga kalok.<verse eid="JOB 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 40:5" />Dong aloko tyen acel keken, pe dong abidok iye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:5">eyo, aloko dong tyen aryo, ci pe dok abimede.”<verse eid="JOB 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Lok ma Lubanga ogamo ki Yubu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 40:6" />Rwot dok ogamo dog Yubu kun loko ki i yamo lapiru ni,<verse eid="JOB 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 40:7" />“Kong iyube, icung matek calo laco;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:7">abipenyi, ci in ibigama.<verse eid="JOB 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 40:8" />Itye kanyutu ni bal tye ikoma ce?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:8">Imito ni lok oloya wek loki aye obed ma atir?<verse eid="JOB 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 40:9" />Itamoni in itye ki tek marom ki mega?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:9">Dwoni mor winye malongo calo mega?<verse eid="JOB 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 40:10" />Ka kitmeno, a malo iruke ki diti dok ki deyoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:10">ka wek tweroni ki woro ma kimiyi onen kamaleng.<verse eid="JOB 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 40:11" />Wek kinigani madwongi okati woko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:11">wek omol ikom jo ma gin luwake ci okwe awakagi woko.<verse eid="JOB 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 40:12" />Nen lyeregi ci idwokgi woko piny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:12">dok inyon jo maracu woko piny kama gucung iye.<verse eid="JOB 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 40:13" />Yikgi woko ducu piny i ngom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:13">um wanggi woko i lyel.<verse eid="JOB 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 40:14" />Ka iromo timo kitmeno ci an abiye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:14">ni iromo lare keni ki tekki.<verse eid="JOB 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 40:15" />Nen Raa mono, lee madit mada;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:15">ma an aye acweyo en macalo acweyo in,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:15">en camo lum calo twon dyang.<verse eid="JOB 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 40:16" />Ento tekone tye i pyere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:16">ki i ler iye manwang.<verse eid="JOB 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 40:17" />Yibe ocung matek liking macalo yat kijing,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:17">ler eme okube kacel.<verse eid="JOB 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 40:18" />Cogone tek calo paipo mola,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:18">tyene calo rii nyonyo.<verse eid="JOB 40:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 40:19" />En tye ginaura madit mada ki ikin gin acweyana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:19">ngat ma ocweyeni keken aye romo tingo pala lucwan ikome.<verse eid="JOB 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 40:20" />Lum ma en camo dongo wa iwi godi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:20">kama lee tim ducu gituku iye.<verse eid="JOB 40:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 40:21" />En butu ite okutu ma i dog kulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:21">ci kane ikin lagada ma i dago.<verse eid="JOB 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 40:22" />Okutu ma i dog kulu giume ki tipugi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:22">yat oget ma inget kulu girume woko dyere.<verse eid="JOB 40:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 40:23" />Kadi bed kulu opong ma mol matek, en pe lworo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:23">dok kadi bed pii ma i kulu Jordan core idoge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:23">en pud bedo ma cwinye opye.<verse eid="JOB 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 40:24" />Itamoni ngat mo twero make ki goli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:24">onyo twero tucu ume ki tong twok?<verse eid="JOB 40:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JOB 41" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 41:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 74:14">Jab 74:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 104:26">104:26</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 27:1">Ica 27:1</ref></char>
    </note>Itamoni itwero ywayo Min Kulu ki goli?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:1">Itwero tweyo lebe ki tol?<verse eid="JOB 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 41:2" />Itamoni itwero rwako tol ogwil i ume,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:2">nyo tucu cwake ki goli?<verse eid="JOB 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 41:3" />Itamoni en bibako doge boti ni iweke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:3">onyo bilok kwedi ki mwolo?<verse eid="JOB 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 41:4" />Itamoni Min Kulu twero cike kwedi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:4">wek ebed opiini matwal?<verse eid="JOB 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 41:5" />Itamoni ibituku kwede calo winyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:5">onyo ibitweyo tyene ki tol wek obed me galo wang anyirani?<verse eid="JOB 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 41:6" />Itamoni lumak rec bilaro wel me wilone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:6">onyo lucatwil bipokone ikin gi me acata?<verse eid="JOB 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 41:7" />Itamoni ibicobo ki dim mabit maromo kome ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:7">onyo ibicobo wiye ki atero mabit me lacob rec?<verse eid="JOB 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 41:8" />Tem gudu kome ki cingi, ci pe ibinwoyo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:8">wii pe biwil ikit ma en lwenyo kwede.<verse eid="JOB 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 41:9" />Ngat ma tamo ni etwero loyo Min Kulu nongo bwole abwola kene;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:9">ka tek onene keken, ci bipoto woko piny.<verse eid="JOB 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 41:10" />Ka kituge, ger ma okato kare;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:10">ci anga maromo cung inyime?<verse eid="JOB 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 41:11" />Anga matwero tugu lweny ikome, ci bwot?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:11">Pe tye ngat mo iwi loboni.<verse eid="JOB 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 41:12" />Wek kong atiti lok ikom tyen Min kulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:12">ki tekone madwong,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:12">ki kit ma dul kome ducu kikubugi kacel maber mada.<verse eid="JOB 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 41:13" />Anga matwero lunyu ginarukane?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:13">Anga matwero tucu kotine me gwoko kome?<verse eid="JOB 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 41:14" />Anga matwero yabo doge?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:14">Lake ma guryeyo idoge kelo lworo mada.<verse eid="JOB 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 41:15" />Dye ngeye kiumu ki kwot ma kiryeyogi i tyeng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:15">ocule cokcok calo kimwono amwona.<verse eid="JOB 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 41:16" />Gukube cokcok kacel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:16">ma yamo pe twero kato ki ikin gi.<verse eid="JOB 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 41:17" />Guribe kacel ma ngat man omoko ikom lawote,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:17">ma gumoko woko liking,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:17">ma pe kitwero poko kin gi.<verse eid="JOB 41:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 41:18" />Ka ojiro, piine mil maryeny aryenya calo ceng</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:18">wange kwar calo ceng matye katuc.<verse eid="JOB 41:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 41:19" />Ineno calo leb mac raa tye kaa ki idoge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:19">ma kir kati woko.<verse eid="JOB 41:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 41:20" />Yito duny ki i ume</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:20">calo pii matye kayenyu ki i agulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:20">nyo macalo togo matye kawang.<verse eid="JOB 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 41:21" />Yweyo me ume miyo mac lyel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:21">dok lebmac lyel kato ki idoge.<verse eid="JOB 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 41:22" />Ngute tek tutwal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:22">ma ka ngat mo orwate kwede ci bedo ki lworo madwong.<verse eid="JOB 41:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 41:23" />Dul kome ojunge kacel, ojing woko matek likitiki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:23">tek calo nyonyo ma okube liking.<verse eid="JOB 41:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 41:24" />Adunune tek calo got,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:24">tek calo min kidi rego.<verse eid="JOB 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 41:25" />Ka otinge malo, oteka ducu gilworo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:25">cwinygi doko nyap, tipu komgi to woko lirut.<verse eid="JOB 41:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 41:26" />Kadi ka dano ocobo ki pala lucwan, pe donyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:26">kadi tong, atero, onyo dim mabit pe wano.<verse eid="JOB 41:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 41:27" />Ki tung bote nyonyo obedo reng kal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:27">mola kono mere rom ki yat ma otop.<verse eid="JOB 41:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 41:28" />Atero pe twero miyo en ringo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:28">ki tung bote lagweng ma kibaye kwede rom ki lum ma otwo.<verse eid="JOB 41:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 41:29" />Odoo koo en lwongo ni tyen gaya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:29">ka kibaye ki tong en nyero mere anyera.<verse eid="JOB 41:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 41:30" />Tung piny iye cal ki labalatek ma lake bit;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:30">ka en woto ci goro daba madyak agora.<verse eid="JOB 41:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 41:31" />En miyo kut yenyo calo pii malyet matye kayenyu ayenya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:31">nam yenyo bwoyo calo bwoyo moo wir ma kitedo ki agulu.<verse eid="JOB 41:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 41:32" />Ka tye kakwang, ci kore ryeny woko matar,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:32">miyo kut kwor woko matar calo lwar wic.<verse eid="JOB 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 41:33" />Pe tye gin mo marom kwede iwi lobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:33">en aye gin ma kicweyo ma pe tye ki lworo wa ki acel.<verse eid="JOB 41:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 41:34" />En cayo lee ducu, ma wake;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:34">en rwot pa lee ducu mawake.”<verse eid="JOB 41:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JOB 42" />
  <para style="s1">Yubu ogamo dog Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 42:1" />Yubu ogamo dog Rwot kun waco ni,<verse eid="JOB 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 42:2" />“Angeyo ni itwero tiyo gin ducu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 42:2">dok yub ma meri weng pe kitwero gengone.<verse eid="JOB 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 42:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 38:2">Yub 38:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ceng iwaco ni, ‘Meno anga mamito umu tama woko ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 42:3">maloko labongo ngeyo gin moni?’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 42:3">Ada, dong awaco lok ma pe aniang tere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 42:3">aloko ikom gin me aura ma ngeyogi loya woko.<verse eid="JOB 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 42:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 38:3">Yub 38:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ceng iwaco ni, ‘Winy lok ma aloko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 42:4">abipenyi ci myero igam doga.’<verse eid="JOB 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 42:5" />Yam onongo awinyo piri awinya keken,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 42:5">ento kombedi dong aneni ki wanga.<verse eid="JOB 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 42:6" />Pimeno lewic maka ikom gin ma aloko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 42:6">ci dong angut ma abuke ki apwa ki buru.”<verse eid="JOB 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s">Lewic omako lurem Yubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 42:7" />Lacen ma Rwot dong otyeko lok ki Yubu, ci ocako waco bot Erifaji Lateman ni, “Kiniga omaka ikomi ki ikom luremi aryoni, pien pe wuloko lok me ada ikoma, kit ma ceng latica Yubu olokoni. <verse eid="JOB 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 42:8" />Kombedi dong wukwany twoni dyangi abiro ki nyogi romi abiro, wucit kwede bot latica Yubu, wek wutyer me gitum awanga pirwu kenwu. Latica Yubu bilego pirwu, ci an abigamo legane, pe abiketo lewic ikomwu ma oporo lokwu; pien pe wuloko lok me ada ikoma kit macalo latica Yubu olokoni.”<verse eid="JOB 42:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 42:9" />Kumeno Erifaji Lateman, Bildad Lacua ki Jopar Lanaamat gucito, gutiyo kit ma onongo Rwot ocikogi kwede; ci Rwot ogamo lega pa Yubu.<verse eid="JOB 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lubanga odwoko gum pa Yubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 42:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 1:1-3">Yub 1:1-3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Rwot odwoko gum pa Yubu, ikare ma en dong olego pi lureme; omiyo bote lim ma wele ododo mayam en tye kwede tyen aryo. <verse eid="JOB 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 42:11" />Kumeno omegine ki lumegine ki jo mayam ngeye wacon, gubino ci gucamo cam kwede i ode. Gunyutu cwercwinygi bote, gukweyo cwinye pi gin marac ducu mayam Rwot okelo ikome. Dano acel acel ikin gi omiye dul lim ki agit jabu. <verse eid="JOB 42:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 42:12" />Rwot omiyo gum ki Yubu i agiki me kwone makato i acakine. En obedo ki romi alip apar wiye angwen, kinaga alip abicel, twoni pur alip aryo, ki megi kana alip acel. <verse eid="JOB 42:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 42:13" />En obedo bene ki awobe abiro ki anyira adek. <verse eid="JOB 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 42:14" />En ocako nying nyako mukwongone ni Yemima, nying me aryone Kejia, ki nying me adeke Keren-apuk. <verse eid="JOB 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 42:15" />Iwi lobo ducu pe onongo tye iye mon mayam gimunya calo anyira pa Yubu. Won gi opoko botgi ginaleya ki ikin omegigi. <verse eid="JOB 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 42:16" />Lacen inge lok meno ducu Yubu orii i lobo dok mwaka miya acel ki pyere angwen, ci oneno awobene ki lutino pa awobene, wa i yalwak me angwen kulu. <verse eid="JOB 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 42:17" />Ci Yubu oto ma otii nikongkong.<verse eid="JOB 42:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 42" />
</usx>